<!doctype lake><title>01-电学基础</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="v5TMO" id="v5TMO"><span data-lake-id="uaae924b8" id="uaae924b8">一、基本概念 </span></h1><p data-lake-id="6e5fc94e906f14cdd35e95d526e04461" id="6e5fc94e906f14cdd35e95d526e04461" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uccd7b3de" id="uccd7b3de" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">本阶段课程主要学习电路基础知识，这些知识可以帮助你更好地理解和应用MCU，提高开 发效率，减少调试和设计错误。我认为以下是需要我们重点理解和把握的点：</span></p><p data-lake-id="5aff2b1d68a09da0469b1b08a108d241" id="5aff2b1d68a09da0469b1b08a108d241" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2a167b00" id="u2a167b00" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电子元件的功能和使用、电路分析、故障排除、硬件和软件结合、多领域知识融合、多样化技能</span></p><p data-lake-id="d25e8035072e4c6c8c9e03629669a82d" id="d25e8035072e4c6c8c9e03629669a82d"><span data-lake-id="uc47bb3a6" id="uc47bb3a6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">大家不要被上述这么多内容吓倒，实际上本阶段课程不难，我相信在座的都是上过初中高中的理科 生，理解这些知识会很快的。而且我们的目的不是成为一个纯硬的开发工程师，所以具备 基础的认识就足够了。</span></p><p data-lake-id="udc3ba51c" id="udc3ba51c"><span data-lake-id="u82f59ab0" id="u82f59ab0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="aWX3v" id="aWX3v"><span data-lake-id="ue77081da" id="ue77081da">1.1 电路</span></h2><p data-lake-id="123bd8f2d3ebd31490c82e4a7da0bad6" id="123bd8f2d3ebd31490c82e4a7da0bad6"><span data-lake-id="uea19777f" id="uea19777f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电路主要由电源、负载和中间环节三部分组成。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7f1178a690df8eea7682e6be0eedde85" id="7f1178a690df8eea7682e6be0eedde85"><span data-lake-id="ue21b3d42" id="ue21b3d42" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">(1) 电源。电源是提供电能的装置，把非电能转换成电能，如电池、蓄电池、发电机等。在发电厂内， 可以将化学能或机械能等非电能转换为电能。</span></p><p data-lake-id="916c4fd4fea858e86b06798283303a92" id="916c4fd4fea858e86b06798283303a92"><span data-lake-id="ua347b535" id="ua347b535" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">(2) 负载。负载是消耗电能的装置，把电能转化成非电能，又称用电器，作用是将电能转换成其他形式 的能量，如电灯、电炉、扬声器、电动机等。</span></p><p data-lake-id="fa3c59cefb6b12c0223a0adaea4fd4b9" id="fa3c59cefb6b12c0223a0adaea4fd4b9"><span data-lake-id="u86bfb3c0" id="u86bfb3c0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">(3) 中间环节。中间环节用来连接电源和负载，起传递和控制电能的作用，如变压器、输电线等。 电路有实际电路与电路模型之分，前者是实际存在的电路，后者是把实际电路在一定条件下理想化而 得到。电路就是电流通过的闭合路径，它是由各种电气器件按一定方式用导线连接组成的总体。</span></p><p data-lake-id="6d8063fd9bcf7fc6a13be8fc814fa6b6" id="6d8063fd9bcf7fc6a13be8fc814fa6b6"><span data-lake-id="ud0c8866c" id="ud0c8866c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="4e59323744c3a6ebdd6a4a5a712694fd" id="4e59323744c3a6ebdd6a4a5a712694fd"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233130481-ac8ab0f2-4408-47c8-9655-0591291c0387.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A284%2C%22originHeight%22%3A199%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i6zyu%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="fa0d892cfd38d109f9d1e74199271b74" id="fa0d892cfd38d109f9d1e74199271b74"><span data-lake-id="ud5e0176e" id="ud5e0176e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">人们把正常接通的电路，即用电器能够工作的电路叫做</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c2c3be6" id="u3c2c3be6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">通路。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="a91beffaecf592573a22c4b5889f0472" id="a91beffaecf592573a22c4b5889f0472"><span data-lake-id="u71ba1af5" id="u71ba1af5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电路中如果某处被切断，电路中就不会有电流流过，这种情况叫做</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufc474d3a" id="ufc474d3a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">断路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8ff09c4" id="ud8ff09c4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">。 直接用导线将电源的正、负极连接起来，这种情况叫做</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e524a7b" id="u4e524a7b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">短路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua8a139f0" id="ua8a139f0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="460c01738691a339301b11406e7ee82e" id="460c01738691a339301b11406e7ee82e"><span data-lake-id="u7c803bd4" id="u7c803bd4" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="a85362d77408661f753db98613475559" id="a85362d77408661f753db98613475559"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233130669-216ebe8e-f21a-4230-b106-1e1fa48d88e4.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A624%2C%22height%22%3A239%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A983%2C%22originHeight%22%3A377%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bgbf7%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="Q3wab" id="Q3wab"><span data-lake-id="u22f6bba8" id="u22f6bba8">1.2 电流</span></h2><p data-lake-id="af8dca650805465fbf6359b7b3472442" id="af8dca650805465fbf6359b7b3472442"><span data-lake-id="uc8326262" id="uc8326262" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">初中物理电流和电路这一章节中告诉我们，导线、小灯泡的灯丝都是金属做的，金属里面有大量自 由电子，它们可以自由移动。平时金属内自由电子运动的方向杂乱无章，但是接上电池之后，它们就 受到了推动力，就会做定向移动，电荷的定向移动形成电流（electric current）</span></p><p data-lake-id="612f4d67f18a938b5b50d5977867edcd" id="612f4d67f18a938b5b50d5977867edcd"><span data-lake-id="u524feb97" id="u524feb97" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="2e1b687cccb93bbb2bfb119b2992dd83" id="2e1b687cccb93bbb2bfb119b2992dd83"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233130844-851d74e9-0a2e-4934-82f7-9b5d81dcab8c.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A444%2C%22height%22%3A258%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A584%2C%22originHeight%22%3A339%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e2cca7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B6tcM%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="af175a5311c77313da11aefbc2e04482" id="af175a5311c77313da11aefbc2e04482" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u02e0e0e4" id="u02e0e0e4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">单位时间内通过导体横截面的电荷量叫电流，通常用I代表电流，电流的单位是安培（这个单位是 为了纪念安培），简称“安”，符号为“A” 。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8a9c3f66c4daad14a5b8fcf210195b47" id="8a9c3f66c4daad14a5b8fcf210195b47" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucc069b3a" id="ucc069b3a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">若电流经过电阻，将产生热；若经过电感，将通过安培力对外做功；若经过发光设备，则发出光。 总之，电流流过的地方，就会有能量转换，即从电能转化为其他形式的能量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="5e89b9f44ce9ae1905a9067c5bec4294" id="5e89b9f44ce9ae1905a9067c5bec4294" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf7bc8ebd" id="uf7bc8ebd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">那么电流究竟是如何产生的呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id="ac0c11f97ffdea2db80d59f6f026ad82" id="ac0c11f97ffdea2db80d59f6f026ad82" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc67bd70d" id="uc67bd70d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">物质是由原子组成，而原子由带正电的原子核和带负电的电子组成，电子围绕着原子核高速运动。</span></p><p data-lake-id="babca985c0346efd4f08982520ad3897" id="babca985c0346efd4f08982520ad3897"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233131006-80b6b8a7-4660-456d-a098-16366390955c.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A332%2C%22originHeight%22%3A253%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qUF7A%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="f287415ab020755ca0c8b6f3a03081c3" id="f287415ab020755ca0c8b6f3a03081c3"><span data-lake-id="u1bf083c1" id="u1bf083c1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电子可以脱离原子核的束缚，逃离这个原子，而使得该原子带1.6*10^-19库仑的正电，而逃脱的这 个电子就带着1.6*10^-19库仑的负电。当物体中大量的电子往一个方向运动时，就形成了电流，电流的 方向与电子运动的方向相反。不同物体的电子逃离原子核的难易程度不一样，所以就有了导体、半导 体和绝缘体之分。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u37d4780e" id="u37d4780e"><span data-lake-id="uc6360c46" id="uc6360c46" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="eec9c7069a0ba289c5d010d99dcc5e26" id="eec9c7069a0ba289c5d010d99dcc5e26" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u73d1f1fe" id="u73d1f1fe" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电流的换算关系：1A=1000毫安（mA），1mA=1000微安（uA），1uA=1000纳安（nA）</span></p><p data-lake-id="63c7d8f771c179949e5c4da78f0e16a1" id="63c7d8f771c179949e5c4da78f0e16a1"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233131377-7fb943f4-e1cf-4a81-8059-a51b20a63072.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A346%2C%22height%22%3A335%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A432%2C%22originHeight%22%3A418%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2395a196%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sWxFL%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="fa09405288996bfd8f3784db788f86fc" id="fa09405288996bfd8f3784db788f86fc" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uae507d00" id="uae507d00" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">查阅手册可知，STM32单片机GPIO口的电流大小为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="00f675d62ccb39534d9960bc5ad825c8" id="00f675d62ccb39534d9960bc5ad825c8"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233131581-a0d29b9b-e504-402e-b98a-3613e1967f75.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A656%2C%22height%22%3A256%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A946%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e4e4e4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GnGUY%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="960fe8741d5011fe1bc6c4b8861f929a" id="960fe8741d5011fe1bc6c4b8861f929a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ufa684bf8" id="ufa684bf8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #4D4D4D">GPIO（通用输入/输出）可以吸收或提供高达+/- 8 mA的电流，并且吸收或提供高达+/- 20 mA的电流  （使用放宽的VOL / VOH）。 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id="pQwA7" id="pQwA7"><span data-lake-id="u6c3accbe" id="u6c3accbe">1.3 电压</span></h2><p data-lake-id="f37c560fd5e0f30240e645df91273a5c" id="f37c560fd5e0f30240e645df91273a5c"><span data-lake-id="u34ce68fd" id="u34ce68fd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电压（Voltage）是电场施加在电荷上的力量，使其在电路中移动的能量。它也被称为电势差。电 压是衡量单位电荷在静电场中由于电势高低不同所产生的能量差的物理量。此概念与水位高低所造成 的“水压”相似。</span></p><p data-lake-id="797067e905e70c1c5c41746aacf8cf90" id="797067e905e70c1c5c41746aacf8cf90" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u95e254cc" id="u95e254cc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">由于重力作用，水会对下面的管道产生压力</span></p><p data-lake-id="734eb6f43b65472640b2467f09450dba" id="734eb6f43b65472640b2467f09450dba"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233131803-a825d05c-de0d-4e00-a8d1-995cfc5d27f2.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A226%2C%22originHeight%22%3A359%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefefc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22khtqc%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="7862e7df711e5e6cb1fb4b9f2286ec98" id="7862e7df711e5e6cb1fb4b9f2286ec98"><span data-lake-id="u2b18faec" id="u2b18faec" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电压的单位是伏特（V），1伏特代表电场对1C电荷做1焦耳功（1V*1A*1s=1J）。电压的换算关 系：1Kv=1000V，1V=1000mV，1mV=1000μV。在电路中，任意两点之间的电位差称为这两点的电 压。</span></p><p data-lake-id="e116f0cbf228efff5159bf65f2d48412" id="e116f0cbf228efff5159bf65f2d48412"><span data-lake-id="u015fcc20" id="u015fcc20" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="c585d2174ca8c68354a5a26fed70a7ae" id="c585d2174ca8c68354a5a26fed70a7ae" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u599165a3" id="u599165a3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">我们用的开发板有1 个直流电源输入接口（输入电压范围：DC6~24V），这只是电压输入口，实际上 开发板内还会对电压进行分压，以适用不用的外设。比如常用的GPIO口输出电压为3.3V</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="iAZ3H" id="iAZ3H"><span data-lake-id="ue48c8ec2" id="ue48c8ec2">1.4 电阻</span></h2><p data-lake-id="fe4cc037a671906a30296b2fd6e413aa" id="fe4cc037a671906a30296b2fd6e413aa" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub86250c3" id="ub86250c3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻：导体对电流的阻碍作用就叫该导体的电阻。</span></p><p data-lake-id="6122726370fdbb25ba8968dd623f5ac3" id="6122726370fdbb25ba8968dd623f5ac3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u1c22a072" id="u1c22a072" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">在物理学中，用电阻来表示导体对电流阻碍作用的大小。导体的电阻越大，表示导体对电流的阻碍作 用越大。导体的电阻通常用字母R表示，单位是欧姆，简称欧，符号是Ω。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8f89d5e8cf2e3f3d404865fa5c919f05" id="8f89d5e8cf2e3f3d404865fa5c919f05" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u03f41525" id="u03f41525" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻的单位换算：1KΩ=1000Ω=10^3Ω，1MΩ=1000000Ω=10^6Ω</span></p><p data-lake-id="e73609675fdcd2d3fcf8e63af3e58831" id="e73609675fdcd2d3fcf8e63af3e58831"><span data-lake-id="ud168e26c" id="ud168e26c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u7bea3588" id="u7bea3588"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1731496070149-847b7b6c-88ff-486c-a562-f30a1a9a0d10.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8f87bcea-f842-4c72-b9fa-a59b560b739%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8a54f886-20d3-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1880%2C%22originHeight%22%3A854%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e3e9f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xfiLU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u756d1478" id="u756d1478" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="z2kU2" id="z2kU2"><span data-lake-id="uf1c0b593" id="uf1c0b593">1.5 其他一些电学基础知识</span></h2><p data-lake-id="a1e961413382b9db100c36ed9c119f90" id="a1e961413382b9db100c36ed9c119f90" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c4d524c" id="u8c4d524c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">直流电</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uab9c45fa" id="uab9c45fa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">&amp;</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue74c74da" id="ue74c74da" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">交流电</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="6f7074d7c77566a4e52a2789f38b810b" id="6f7074d7c77566a4e52a2789f38b810b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9de7745b" id="u9de7745b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">交流电（AC）是全球最广泛使用的电力形式，其特点在于电流的极性会周期性反转，交流电具有 易于转换和远距离传输的优点，因此在电力网络中广泛使用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="0490aca2c58e206ac3c1d06d85e2076e" id="0490aca2c58e206ac3c1d06d85e2076e"><span data-lake-id="uf40bde6d" id="uf40bde6d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">直流电（DC）是另一种主要的电力形式，其特点是电子流在一个稳定的方向上持续流动。与交流 电相比，直流电保持恒定的极性，不会发生反转。尽管直流电在公共电力网络中并不常见，但它在电 子设备和低压应用领域具有广泛的应用。我们学习的STM32开发板用的就是直流电。</span></p><p data-lake-id="929979777e2f7515bd580a32cbf92c11" id="929979777e2f7515bd580a32cbf92c11"><span data-lake-id="u5cfe0b28" id="u5cfe0b28" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="36b41f7d010d4aa0d7f85b40a4f7d245" id="36b41f7d010d4aa0d7f85b40a4f7d245"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233132260-2fe0f552-a857-4442-a5cd-78335cbdf61d.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A641%2C%22height%22%3A264%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A929%2C%22originHeight%22%3A383%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mMSM0%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="0547f236d4c9176b1cd0ac56ab31bdd4" id="0547f236d4c9176b1cd0ac56ab31bdd4" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u861876b5" id="u861876b5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">弱电和强电</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="5b57867ec90c6ec0f0086402d7472e20" id="5b57867ec90c6ec0f0086402d7472e20" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u42985882" id="u42985882" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">弱电一般电压较低，国家规定的安全电压是交流36V以下、直流24V以下。弱电通常用于直流电路 （3.3V、5V、12V）、音频和视频线路、网络线路、电话线等。弱电常用于信号传递。</span></p><p data-lake-id="308772a66047c68cf240e9ce28fbac1a" id="308772a66047c68cf240e9ce28fbac1a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233132488-dc2d4d98-c024-4810-9902-f2500e485c90.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A640%2C%22height%22%3A239%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A728%2C%22originHeight%22%3A272%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%237d8780%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pcRyT%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ba2710c8a18c0859f4fe3fa2922e45cc" id="ba2710c8a18c0859f4fe3fa2922e45cc" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub384654a" id="ub384654a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">强电一般电压较高，比如，220V的家用电，1000多伏及以上的高压电。强电常用于传递能量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="19c7a196da9e3ebef4c6de583a0de027" id="19c7a196da9e3ebef4c6de583a0de027"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233132681-feac8b85-2423-4c0d-bd60-c7c1a8d6a523.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A599%2C%22height%22%3A154%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A714%2C%22originHeight%22%3A184%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23847f71%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DXPBr%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d375295ac8c597337222e56b2b113943" id="d375295ac8c597337222e56b2b113943" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua7f2c5ad" id="ua7f2c5ad" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #F23232">一般弱电平台用手直接触摸不会造成人身危险，最多静电击穿元器件挂掉；但是强电平台一定不能 用手直接触摸，会有生命危险！！！</span></p><p data-lake-id="6b887034042d1aa82d84150c7ecbfdf8" id="6b887034042d1aa82d84150c7ecbfdf8"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233132899-cee62f78-a4c9-483f-b498-065edcdfd47d.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A339%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A477%2C%22originHeight%22%3A602%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bcbd97%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VDiLN%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="7a26777b93f134b446d913eb9ddf6b07" id="7a26777b93f134b446d913eb9ddf6b07" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0048f72a" id="u0048f72a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">小心接反了电源，导致小模块爆炸了...........，小电流也有大威力，一定要注意用电安 全。</span></p><p data-lake-id="aa3f91b04d0ddb22ad21124cdf41f5e2" id="aa3f91b04d0ddb22ad21124cdf41f5e2"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233133175-88ab28a6-3abe-4127-ac88-09e92df3fedc.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A464%2C%22originHeight%22%3A524%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%235d7a76%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jooYG%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="OBGYs" id="OBGYs"><span data-lake-id="u3e225e17" id="u3e225e17">二、电路定律</span><span data-lake-id="ua7b74f2d" id="ua7b74f2d" style="color: #009587"> </span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="mjbe8" id="mjbe8"><span data-lake-id="u694e3c3a" id="u694e3c3a">2.1 欧姆定律</span></h2><p data-lake-id="f4b616de1f41704f4f9f2d683995f203" id="f4b616de1f41704f4f9f2d683995f203" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc0f62cd9" id="uc0f62cd9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">通过某段导体的电流跟这段导体两端的电压成正比，跟这段导体的电阻成反比。</span></p><p data-lake-id="85d38ea26858ccf9cf336e262ffc431f" id="85d38ea26858ccf9cf336e262ffc431f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9237062d" id="u9237062d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">I=U/R；</span><span data-lake-id="u6bdcfdfd" id="u6bdcfdfd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">这个公式表明，在电阻不变的情况下，电压和电流成正比.</span></p><p data-lake-id="dd9d7c2adf67ae239d739f20ab2c8ea3" id="dd9d7c2adf67ae239d739f20ab2c8ea3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u45313718" id="u45313718" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如下图电</span><span data-lake-id="ueb019e22" id="ueb019e22" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">路电阻R=100Ω，电压U=12V，电流I=U/R=12/100=0.12A</span></p><p data-lake-id="67e7304331c0eb280e2d6406c88e1b3a" id="67e7304331c0eb280e2d6406c88e1b3a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233133502-e1fef486-c3a7-4aaa-bf0c-b1b04e1ddfcd.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A469%2C%22height%22%3A170%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A655%2C%22originHeight%22%3A238%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfdfd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QYLbA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="nn3Vq" id="nn3Vq"><span data-lake-id="ud3fc3a7b" id="ud3fc3a7b">2.2 功率</span></h2><p data-lake-id="23cb7283ddb1842d966442fe6d3d73f3" id="23cb7283ddb1842d966442fe6d3d73f3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u963a0d7b" id="u963a0d7b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">指物体在单位时间内所做的功的多少,即功率是描述做功快慢的物理量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="5cc06668fc7d62e56ff5f793de9f878f" id="5cc06668fc7d62e56ff5f793de9f878f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4ecc218a" id="u4ecc218a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">P=U*I</span></p><p data-lake-id="e1d8f7c5787cf9069196a137aca79fce" id="e1d8f7c5787cf9069196a137aca79fce" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf46f2d96" id="uf46f2d96" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如小风扇工作时电压2.6V，工作电流为0.02A，小风扇的功率为P=UI=2.6V*0.02A=0.052W</span></p><p data-lake-id="67f0272fe6fe6e64c8ebf98d0998526a" id="67f0272fe6fe6e64c8ebf98d0998526a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233133666-6cf40ffc-cd68-4e46-ae92-72d59c934d14.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A476%2C%22height%22%3A272%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A589%2C%22originHeight%22%3A336%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D5nYt%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="de017" id="de017"><span data-lake-id="u2a6fb8dd" id="u2a6fb8dd">2.3 串联与并联电路</span></h2><p data-lake-id="badc2207f9ae08fb7a3d208794698253" id="badc2207f9ae08fb7a3d208794698253"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233133809-877ec217-4bfc-439e-838d-d65f042b42fe.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A436%2C%22originHeight%22%3A28%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23dddddd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tqnnA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="169c2a3512c2ebf5826fbdfb0b6b7436" id="169c2a3512c2ebf5826fbdfb0b6b7436"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233133942-694f981b-6734-4be3-a116-e74b46942adb.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A539%2C%22originHeight%22%3A32%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e2e2e2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yqv9q%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="83eec7b203ec98ebcc0654deb3b81cbc" id="83eec7b203ec98ebcc0654deb3b81cbc"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233134121-0088863e-8ea1-4995-914b-ef1b1ddc8503.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A904%2C%22originHeight%22%3A28%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e2e2e2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zx6jL%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="36bab387301c0e57de80e8db60c902b5" id="36bab387301c0e57de80e8db60c902b5"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233134333-9b04734e-9e23-42d5-a80a-21f53f6face8.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A503%2C%22height%22%3A199%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A664%2C%22originHeight%22%3A263%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y1kRU%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="48c01f07632e594678bc96110e0c2d18" id="48c01f07632e594678bc96110e0c2d18"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233134571-fc1272dc-a6d4-4a86-8a83-cbd5a1ad4360.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A982%2C%22originHeight%22%3A137%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DmdkL%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="2e6a11863fecbb38200a2ea8bc7e1b49" id="2e6a11863fecbb38200a2ea8bc7e1b49"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233134809-51698252-71ba-4790-a038-3ff489fff50a.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A456%2C%22height%22%3A271%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A699%2C%22originHeight%22%3A416%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G3tsF%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub84fec2b" id="ub84fec2b"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22gotSd%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b54801e" id="u0b54801e" class="lake-fontsize-12">:</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc5c2e809" id="uc5c2e809"><span data-lake-id="u27ad8e70" id="u27ad8e70" class="lake-fontsize-12">查阅数据手册，我们指导 LED 通过最大电流为 20mA，如果我们使用 9v 电池去接 LED，我们需要串联多少欧姆的电阻？</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6cd26db8" id="u6cd26db8"><span data-lake-id="u8d266eb6" id="u8d266eb6" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算步骤------》</span></p><ol list="uec1820fa"><li fid="u31256c8d" data-lake-id="ud4d2bcc3" id="ud4d2bcc3"><span data-lake-id="uad4ecf4b" id="uad4ecf4b" class="lake-fontsize-12">从立创商城下载所选 LED 数据手册</span></li><li fid="u31256c8d" data-lake-id="ued7ce25b" id="ued7ce25b"><span data-lake-id="u8771ac64" id="u8771ac64" class="lake-fontsize-12">查看 LED 工作电压</span></li><li fid="u31256c8d" data-lake-id="u0e7fe09a" id="u0e7fe09a"><span data-lake-id="ua53af1b7" id="ua53af1b7" class="lake-fontsize-12">查看 LED 工作电流</span></li><li fid="u31256c8d" data-lake-id="u0868525e" id="u0868525e"><span data-lake-id="u37df8f7f" id="u37df8f7f" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算剩余电路中的电压---》串联分压</span></li><li fid="u31256c8d" data-lake-id="ua7babd34" id="ua7babd34"><span data-lake-id="u586fe810" id="u586fe810" class="lake-fontsize-12">根据欧姆定律（I=U/R）计算电阻</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id="unVLt" id="unVLt"><span data-lake-id="u40900970" id="u40900970">2.4 基尔霍夫定律</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue253a7e8" id="ue253a7e8"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786016264587-9de73e9a-af90-4c18-8874-4d1aa160cf05.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1ec6d5e7-7377-487f-9cad-f44fe148e40%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bf95918-ee60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A420%2C%22height%22%3A172%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A41647%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A382%2C%22originHeight%22%3A156%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22GUSTAY%20ROBERT%20KIRCHHOFF%20(1824-1887)%20%E5%9F%BA%E5%B0%94%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%2F%E5%85%8B%E8%A5%BF%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%20%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A187%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A14%2C%22text%22%3A%22GUSTAY%20ROBERT%20KIRCHHOFF%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A190%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22(1824-1887)%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A187%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%B0%94%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%2F%E5%85%8B%E8%A5%BF%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A16%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d0d0d0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufc716e10%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="UzF5k" id="UzF5k" class="lake-lineheight-115"><span data-lake-id="uda37eb1d" id="uda37eb1d">2.4.1 电路</span><span data-lake-id="u4f0db553" id="u4f0db553" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">拓扑</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u8fe39bf4" id="u8fe39bf4"><span data-lake-id="u81f410c6" id="u81f410c6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">电路拓扑又称电路的图，即电路结构，是对电路图进行再次抽象、仅由支路和结点构成的一个集合，它讨论的是电路的连接关系及其性质，即支路与结点的连接关系。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uba7839ca" id="uba7839ca"><span data-lake-id="u8576af2a" id="u8576af2a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">1、支路(branch):电路中通过同一电流的一个分支 (b)。<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u762bacc1" id="u762bacc1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">2、结点 (node):3条或3条以上的支路的连接点称为结点(n)。<br /></span><span data-lake-id="ubdfe1ab3" id="ubdfe1ab3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">3、回路(loop):由支路组成的闭合路径(l)。<br /></span><span data-lake-id="ubc31f28c" id="ubc31f28c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">4、网孔(mesh):不包含支路的回路(m).</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf9349019" id="uf9349019"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786016315987-e3f7e831-8f23-4160-8214-288ffb266103.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u29b4095c-acfb-4762-9cb3-35a6b289300%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bf95918-ee60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A212.5%2C%22height%22%3A129%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A68129%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A425%2C%22originHeight%22%3A257%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%223%20R%20RZ%20PLL%20%E5%8D%81%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A263%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A24%2C%22text%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A34%2C%22text%22%3A%22R%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A28%2C%22text%22%3A%22RZ%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A58%2C%22text%22%3A%22PLL%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6f78ae84%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub946db09" id="ub946db09"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786017637272-35cf327c-f86b-4041-b52e-a4a66806e7ad.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4ac73226-015b-415f-bad3-313a6589127%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bf95918-ee60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A361%2C%22height%22%3A343%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A184401%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A722%2C%22originHeight%22%3A685%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22R6%20R%20X%201%20-SU%20R3%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A40%2C%22text%22%3A%22R6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%22R%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A261%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A26%2C%22text%22%3A%22X%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A500%2C%22y%22%3A437%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A39%2C%22text%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A606%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A64%2C%22text%22%3A%22-SU%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A610%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A48%2C%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1e7b22f7%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="VoWhW" id="VoWhW"><span data-lake-id="u72fccee5" id="u72fccee5">2.4.2 电流定律</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ud55f0363" id="ud55f0363"><span data-lake-id="u0038003a" id="u0038003a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">在集总电路中，任一时刻，流过任一结点的各支路电流的代数和恒为零。即</span></p><p data-lake-id="uad1db03b" id="uad1db03b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786017699737-76efd480-9808-47c0-9420-044bdbff2bf8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u12023eb1-7000-42c6-8b97-c532a3b0399%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bf95918-ee60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A407%2C%22height%22%3A133%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A774%2C%22originHeight%22%3A252%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f4f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u38957c55%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ueff8de14" id="ueff8de14"><span data-lake-id="uf0b18829" id="uf0b18829" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)">在集总电路中，任一时刻，流入结点的支路电流之和恒等于流出该结点的支路电流之和。基尔霍夫电流定律是电荷守恒定律的具体表现.</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2e85031b" id="u2e85031b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786017699764-812175d2-8466-42e7-97eb-57b97bd6bdd9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua9f21e71-b3f0-49c9-9713-23983e0c1ff%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bf95918-ee60-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A364%2C%22height%22%3A68%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A360%2C%22originHeight%22%3A67%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f3f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufc657d56%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(16, 16, 16)"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9b269c58" id="u9b269c58"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A4%2C%22id%22%3A%22ID5Sn%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ucdaaa8b3" id="ucdaaa8b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">：计算电流 I1 和 I2 的值</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue903cfdf" id="ue903cfdf"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786438683372-f4d250cf-bb36-414e-bf28-f6b629905bc6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4d145789-a01e-4044-8894-5f6c0d6c943%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u62c6cae0-7284-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A460.5%2C%22height%22%3A232%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A16409%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A529%2C%22originHeight%22%3A267%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%2210A%20I2%205A%203%2010A%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A15%2C%22text%22%3A%2210A%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A17%2C%22text%22%3A%22I2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A15%2C%22text%22%3A%225A%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A368%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A15%2C%22text%22%3A%2210A%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud8aa1694%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="V6n5H" id="V6n5H"><span data-lake-id="u143c173e" id="u143c173e">2.5 模拟电路仿真软件——CircuitJS </span></h2><p data-lake-id="6213e75a40ff8464c3a967baf4fcdaf2" id="6213e75a40ff8464c3a967baf4fcdaf2" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u740d341f" id="u740d341f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">推荐大家一款软件，可用作电路仿真，轻量级，适合初学者了解电路原理。软件是绿色的，解压即可 使用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="598c2a04763f85ef5d08485d4547e649" id="598c2a04763f85ef5d08485d4547e649"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233135012-a1bc1909-1347-4b45-b862-606434f7d053.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A544%2C%22height%22%3A503%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A950%2C%22originHeight%22%3A879%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a6a5a4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sy1oq%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="99c2f6823a833f2734bb03b4f24aa2ab" id="99c2f6823a833f2734bb03b4f24aa2ab" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud8cd6532" id="ud8cd6532" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">详细的操作教学可以翻看手册《CircuitJS仿真软件基础使用.pdf》</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="eqC6I" id="eqC6I"><span data-lake-id="ue486df4b" id="ue486df4b">三、 STM32常见的电子元器件 </span></h1><p data-lake-id="cc449003967b850cd418f32fca53e198" id="cc449003967b850cd418f32fca53e198" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4cf3e9c2" id="u4cf3e9c2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容，和电感、电阻，是电子学三大基本元器件，在后续学习STM32中，可能会遇到的一些其他电子元 器件，本章重点介绍常见的元器件。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uadeed708" id="uadeed708" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1786015541984-00ebbbe3-0d6a-4242-9e79-228ba002d069.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ueeffa7ab-a279-4b99-9dd4-329518e0fc7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucd27a8ea-252b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A409%2C%22height%22%3A187%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A33824%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A426%2C%22originHeight%22%3A195%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22TO%E4%B8%80%E7%94%B5%20%E7%94%B5%E9%98%BB%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%20%E6%97%A0%E6%BA%90%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%20%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%20WW%20%E7%94%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%20%E7%94%B5%E6%B5%81%E6%BA%90%20%E6%9C%89%E6%BA%90%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%20%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E6%BA%90%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A23%2C%22text%22%3A%22TO%E4%B8%80%E7%94%B5%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E9%98%BB%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%97%A0%E6%BA%90%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A17%2C%22text%22%3A%22WW%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E6%B5%81%E6%BA%90%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A255%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%89%E6%BA%90%E5%85%83%E4%BB%B6%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E6%BA%90%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf7ba603c%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="MwUKn" id="MwUKn"><span data-lake-id="u0a293022" id="u0a293022">3.1 电阻器</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="TBXHH" id="TBXHH"><span data-lake-id="ubf36e66c" id="ubf36e66c">3.1.1 参数</span></h3><p data-lake-id="d033466f70dee15816ccd3fc16d68f2a" id="d033466f70dee15816ccd3fc16d68f2a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub29ef1db" id="ub29ef1db" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻器是产生电阻的元器件。主要作用是阻碍导体中电流的流动。</span></p><p data-lake-id="b7e8faee84ced71f6d2516fd4c4718f5" id="b7e8faee84ced71f6d2516fd4c4718f5"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233135299-c990b732-ba1f-4868-aeb7-5ba08936a7da.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A455%2C%22height%22%3A289%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A796%2C%22originHeight%22%3A505%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a0e28e%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22skPxx%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="bef542c94507fb8f233e67c31858ca13" id="bef542c94507fb8f233e67c31858ca13" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4d38dd46" id="u4d38dd46" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">我们在生产环境中了解电阻时，需要重点关注如下几个参数：</span></p><p data-lake-id="b037b1f131b4197affdc63a69bd53573" id="b037b1f131b4197affdc63a69bd53573" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue2ae7c5f" id="ue2ae7c5f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）阻值</span></p><p data-lake-id="0de9e27d29732569fdb3d34454db03f5" id="0de9e27d29732569fdb3d34454db03f5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue4adf42c" id="ue4adf42c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻的阻值越大，表示阻碍电流的能力越强。反之，电阻阻值越小，表示阻碍电流的能力越弱。我们 需要根据实际电路的需要去选择合适阻值的电阻。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ae5ff82d692110ff782eb1d26de52da1" id="ae5ff82d692110ff782eb1d26de52da1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u35f43d86" id="u35f43d86" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）功率</span></p><p data-lake-id="eae8cfffb1e5ba26d88e888cd07ff412" id="eae8cfffb1e5ba26d88e888cd07ff412" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue0302ca5" id="ue0302ca5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻器的额定功率：指电阻在正常气候条件下（如大气压、环境温度等），长时间连续安全工作可耗 散或可承受的最大功率。例如电阻功率是0.25w，电阻阻值是1k，</span></p><p data-lake-id="a7b9cfe86c3e99d6760f559100f2b5a3" id="a7b9cfe86c3e99d6760f559100f2b5a3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua0ab9bce" id="ua0ab9bce" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">那么根据公式P=I^2R=&gt;0.25w</span></p><p data-lake-id="847e723b9d5cb952f0ae551ed6d3a704" id="847e723b9d5cb952f0ae551ed6d3a704" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u1a75f96a" id="u1a75f96a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">I^2* 1000Ω=&gt; 0.25w</span></p><p data-lake-id="1ca60d2d6f1c34459720cb6ed2767f60" id="1ca60d2d6f1c34459720cb6ed2767f60" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8c94bf5d" id="u8c94bf5d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">I=0.015A =15mA，通过该电阻的电流长时间操作15mA，电阻容易损坏。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7d435aef61f21291083c5976671fc9a6" id="7d435aef61f21291083c5976671fc9a6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u923afea5" id="u923afea5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）精度</span></p><p data-lake-id="191bddf8ef1f43807d312a467d6054da" id="191bddf8ef1f43807d312a467d6054da" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf63c8a16" id="uf63c8a16" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">一般情况下，电阻的精度一般有1%和5%，精密的要0.1%等。精度越高，价格越贵。0.1%的价格大约 是1%的十倍，1%的价格大约是5%的1.3倍。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="kYnYp" id="kYnYp"><span data-lake-id="ube92c6f1" id="ube92c6f1">3.1.2 固定电阻</span></h3><p data-lake-id="b06faa7b055e08b2e816523cb6ac42f7" id="b06faa7b055e08b2e816523cb6ac42f7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u934be799" id="u934be799" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">一般电路用的电阻都是固定电阻，这一类电阻也是我们生活中最常见的。按照生产工艺大概可以分为 以下几类。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uac96f4f5" id="uac96f4f5"><span data-lake-id="u296b4e31" id="u296b4e31" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）碳膜电阻</span></p><p data-lake-id="8af9e8d40ca5c34a7290ce5f8e311f7f" id="8af9e8d40ca5c34a7290ce5f8e311f7f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u678b8da4" id="u678b8da4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/3140120.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u6b884c7b" id="u6b884c7b"><span data-lake-id="u5508c4fd" id="u5508c4fd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/3140120.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="ue82045df" id="ue82045df" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="5ac5caed1b26fd80bd1965da093440c9" id="5ac5caed1b26fd80bd1965da093440c9" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u6f393847" id="u6f393847" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：碳膜电阻主要用于家用电器等民用领域。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8e26b423e6f0389f1805ee1715308d13" id="8e26b423e6f0389f1805ee1715308d13" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u47c6173e" id="u47c6173e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #FF0000">实物、原理图、封装：</span></p><p data-lake-id="a68329331ca2f5c8c87e6d74c96253a4" id="a68329331ca2f5c8c87e6d74c96253a4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233135524-bd9b053e-1dd7-4987-9963-a945d093e8cc.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A634%2C%22height%22%3A208%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A949%2C%22originHeight%22%3A311%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%239a9b56%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MbbbJ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="8486de1b68ed49674257ba6487098b54" id="8486de1b68ed49674257ba6487098b54"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233135700-ccf3f1c9-1e55-4885-8197-6a4d616477ad.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A9%2C%22originHeight%22%3A13%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ededed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubOa8%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="6231c901c6d2cc9189f6378a85736b72" id="6231c901c6d2cc9189f6378a85736b72" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u794f34b5" id="u794f34b5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">数据手册可在立创商城，商品详情页下载，后面的元器件不再赘述</span></p><p data-lake-id="99073a1cfff12f4c255012093734bc77" id="99073a1cfff12f4c255012093734bc77"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233135846-ad05013f-f1ca-4170-8963-94549114e796.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A614%2C%22originHeight%22%3A267%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oU7w1%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="de9e680d1b353192e3c1f6cf80aa9a88" id="de9e680d1b353192e3c1f6cf80aa9a88" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2ff37287" id="u2ff37287" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2）金属膜电阻</span></p><p data-lake-id="d448344476fa824db8ef637e08fda179" id="d448344476fa824db8ef637e08fda179" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4ce973f6" id="u4ce973f6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/754322.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u4577feca" id="u4577feca"><span data-lake-id="u1378d14d" id="u1378d14d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/754322.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u69475b03" id="u69475b03" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="43104db6761dd123849f62079bed83f3" id="43104db6761dd123849f62079bed83f3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u192cb71a" id="u192cb71a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：金属膜电阻精度较高，一般多用于精密仪器或医疗设备等领域。</span></p><p data-lake-id="029e75ce0812309f3bd2468e5c33a3c2" id="029e75ce0812309f3bd2468e5c33a3c2"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233136067-c2e23c24-2a01-4e4a-83d0-729a01f222a0.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A998%2C%22originHeight%22%3A324%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a2a247%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zm8NF%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="60fddc1de2fb1f294aee639fa0ec73e5" id="60fddc1de2fb1f294aee639fa0ec73e5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3b56949f" id="u3b56949f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3）线绕电阻</span></p><p data-lake-id="539deff8b5dd7e8ece3244824078cb9e" id="539deff8b5dd7e8ece3244824078cb9e" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u33fa1b35" id="u33fa1b35" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/631181.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u16758682" id="u16758682"><span data-lake-id="u684007a0" id="u684007a0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/631181.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="uda50d563" id="uda50d563" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="7b9caccb359535425add5f7e6b227854" id="7b9caccb359535425add5f7e6b227854" style="text-align: left"><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/3236618.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="uac33035d" id="uac33035d"><span data-lake-id="u1048ffed" id="u1048ffed" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/3236618.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u212497ff" id="u212497ff" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="18bdfb6b36a838e3825859b6cc9e0e04" id="18bdfb6b36a838e3825859b6cc9e0e04"><span data-lake-id="u4691b3d0" id="u4691b3d0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：线绕电阻就是由金属丝紧密绕在一个非导电的陶瓷、玻璃或塑料芯子上制成。这些电阻的 主要特点是它们能承受较高的功率（例如5w，10w，20w），具有非常低的温度系数，且提供高度的 精度和稳定性，常用于高功率，过载保护或者环境恶劣的场合。由于这类电阻电感较高，对于高频响 应非常差，不能用于高频场合。</span></p><p data-lake-id="d4347e4713fc9d5db44eb7c2c8f5f54b" id="d4347e4713fc9d5db44eb7c2c8f5f54b"><span data-lake-id="u7b80db8b" id="u7b80db8b" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="07138258cded911d5784b137a17affc4" id="07138258cded911d5784b137a17affc4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233136366-a43c6788-a9fe-418e-aa3f-9d8fba6558fb.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A493%2C%22height%22%3A320%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A968%2C%22originHeight%22%3A628%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2331412c%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22omFkL%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="e11827e62cb6c731814f7ae34702b88c" id="e11827e62cb6c731814f7ae34702b88c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue8a2cea8" id="ue8a2cea8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">4）厚膜电阻</span></p><p data-lake-id="182bf0df535f0aafa9428cca09e0bd50" id="182bf0df535f0aafa9428cca09e0bd50" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u6db5804b" id="u6db5804b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/650544.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u96ab3c8e" id="u96ab3c8e"><span data-lake-id="u3ba3aa13" id="u3ba3aa13" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/650544.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u7a76af5f" id="u7a76af5f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="664b782b43949ee7107a17da79d6c4c5" id="664b782b43949ee7107a17da79d6c4c5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u7fa69725" id="u7fa69725" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：厚膜电阻成本较低，精度不高，所以广泛应用于主流电子产品；</span></p><p data-lake-id="0439b1f473aea3788cf77f753894803b" id="0439b1f473aea3788cf77f753894803b"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233136628-5ace98e4-41af-409f-8371-bc89293dddea.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A648%2C%22height%22%3A158%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A990%2C%22originHeight%22%3A242%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b0b039%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SDWgz%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="120392eaa8176743af156e61b3abcc6f" id="120392eaa8176743af156e61b3abcc6f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud25f5afb" id="ud25f5afb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">5）薄膜电阻</span></p><p data-lake-id="50e18c38fb12d1a557cca6422ca31fd5" id="50e18c38fb12d1a557cca6422ca31fd5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue97903f7" id="ue97903f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/112001.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="ubfd61f06" id="ubfd61f06"><span data-lake-id="ufbefb425" id="ufbefb425" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/112001.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="uf07cc483" id="uf07cc483" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="188ae8df80127329bb2a341b5aab019b" id="188ae8df80127329bb2a341b5aab019b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5fb0b1b0" id="u5fb0b1b0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：薄膜电阻成本更高，精度也更高，更多的应用于精密仪器，军工航空等高精度要求场合。</span></p><p data-lake-id="be278d82da4d4246eb7b366cc6f2bcf3" id="be278d82da4d4246eb7b366cc6f2bcf3"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233136789-0248e082-1f71-4fba-9cfe-8428c73a5074.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A690%2C%22height%22%3A140%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A998%2C%22originHeight%22%3A203%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c3c339%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HgrAu%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="oHzZZ" id="oHzZZ"><span data-lake-id="u5c09c875" id="u5c09c875">3.1.3 其他电阻</span></h3><p data-lake-id="4603fbda1256e55f23757acafe43458f" id="4603fbda1256e55f23757acafe43458f" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4cba097c" id="u4cba097c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">可变电阻</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="3710b67fae597a075bd3214c6fa07140" id="3710b67fae597a075bd3214c6fa07140" style="text-align: left"><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/120223.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u395ed81d" id="u395ed81d"><span data-lake-id="ua590798f" id="ua590798f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/120223.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u3802b0dd" id="u3802b0dd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="4c569e994cf3c22f172e438833f725ed" id="4c569e994cf3c22f172e438833f725ed" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucdf22c55" id="ucdf22c55" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">可变电阻一般用于家庭、商业、舞台灯光等场景中，通过控制电阻的阻值来调节灯光的亮度和颜色。</span></p><p data-lake-id="3391fe0c6593d1f17975d75670eee257" id="3391fe0c6593d1f17975d75670eee257"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137010-23a44d18-2b2a-4aac-81f7-8a7489147eb9.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A582%2C%22height%22%3A160%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A983%2C%22originHeight%22%3A271%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c9c9bf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zSksX%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="c357d789c34c8f6f4d54580ef898fff7" id="c357d789c34c8f6f4d54580ef898fff7" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub618b422" id="ub618b422" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">光敏电阻</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="507cb34277e2fa0d00809f6f62176f3e" id="507cb34277e2fa0d00809f6f62176f3e" style="text-align: left"><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/10620.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u174e8de1" id="u174e8de1"><span data-lake-id="u7b4b3b32" id="u7b4b3b32" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/10620.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="ua7278f63" id="ua7278f63" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="637bc80afc3834112ee833003ceb487d" id="637bc80afc3834112ee833003ceb487d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u650b20a0" id="u650b20a0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">光敏电阻随着光照强度的增加，阻值降低。一般用在光线检测、照明控制、报警系统等场合。</span></p><p data-lake-id="f1a1f5b2c2bb00b819a5eac7c2269e90" id="f1a1f5b2c2bb00b819a5eac7c2269e90"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137203-5dbd34ed-5e60-4116-aeee-19a240a51251.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A564%2C%22height%22%3A162%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A981%2C%22originHeight%22%3A282%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%233e402f%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q7z9H%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="821381e518fc1af252a2217f27bfd5e1" id="821381e518fc1af252a2217f27bfd5e1" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u119f2a73" id="u119f2a73" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">压敏电阻</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="245b769c86aeda9bff6c4f759954e2aa" id="245b769c86aeda9bff6c4f759954e2aa" style="text-align: left"><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/9271.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u9d32f685" id="u9d32f685"><span data-lake-id="u249a8c85" id="u249a8c85" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/9271.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u079f8fa0" id="u079f8fa0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="84ccecae6821307fd87b544ebadacd25" id="84ccecae6821307fd87b544ebadacd25" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u39845c95" id="u39845c95" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">压敏电阻两端电压超过额定电压时，阻值降低。一般用在吸收过电压、浪涌保护和雷击保护等场合。</span></p><p data-lake-id="152334aea1e0cf648934187e5be04172" id="152334aea1e0cf648934187e5be04172"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137388-2cd3b178-7af8-4855-8e3b-dd9a00d2b0a0.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A571%2C%22height%22%3A163%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A993%2C%22originHeight%22%3A284%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a4a550%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OvZy7%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="q9zUP" id="q9zUP"><span data-lake-id="u42d52a3c" id="u42d52a3c">3.1.4 识别电阻阻值</span></h3><p data-lake-id="b95f218f75998e06f32c3f567bd7dca7" id="b95f218f75998e06f32c3f567bd7dca7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4bf6526c" id="u4bf6526c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）直标法</span></p><p data-lake-id="50b5d3ecddaa4081efc2f489ada10fc1" id="50b5d3ecddaa4081efc2f489ada10fc1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf3a12811" id="uf3a12811" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">直标法就是将电阻器的类别、标称阻值、允许偏差及额定功率等直接标注在电阻器的外表面上。</span></p><p data-lake-id="76dee43df660fcc5972bb0e8dd767e59" id="76dee43df660fcc5972bb0e8dd767e59"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137577-90658b70-d222-41c0-a583-3050fe77d19e.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A598%2C%22height%22%3A136%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A975%2C%22originHeight%22%3A222%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a89d94%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wTghw%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="052639428d4ff9cdd02ff4bc1cbc745c" id="052639428d4ff9cdd02ff4bc1cbc745c"><span data-lake-id="u2b5631bb" id="u2b5631bb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">阻值200Ω，误差J=±5% </span></p><p data-lake-id="afff4611c2ef5307c11865c73f146244" id="afff4611c2ef5307c11865c73f146244"><span data-lake-id="u9cf986c6" id="u9cf986c6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">精度代号A=±0.05% 、B=±0.1% 、C=±0.25% 、D=±0.5% 、F=±1% 、G=±2% 、</span><span data-lake-id="u2543b8b9" id="u2543b8b9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #FF0000">J=±5% </span><span data-lake-id="u97455d43" id="u97455d43" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">、K=±10% 、 M=±20% 。</span></p><p data-lake-id="173c041bde3850e7fa7d9461790c06e9" id="173c041bde3850e7fa7d9461790c06e9"><span data-lake-id="u0dce2230" id="u0dce2230" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="de321548f9407f401f7a9a5e98491839" id="de321548f9407f401f7a9a5e98491839" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud47c28f6" id="ud47c28f6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2）两位有效数字电阻读法</span></p><p data-lake-id="be856da1e179cc07c42c1e762934d539" id="be856da1e179cc07c42c1e762934d539" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf0abc7fa" id="uf0abc7fa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">在电阻体上用三位数字来标明其阻值，一般用于±5% 精度的电阻。它的前2有效数字，第3位表示在有 效数字后面所加“0” 的个数，其中R表示小数点。</span></p><p data-lake-id="85944a433216a974c3e1124cf89c73a1" id="85944a433216a974c3e1124cf89c73a1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u459de60c" id="u459de60c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如：“472” 表示“4700 Ω”，“151” 表示“150 Ω”。如果是小数.则用“R” 表示“小数点”. 并占用一位有效数 字，其余两位是有效数字。例如：“2R4” 表示“2.4 Ω”，“R15” 表示“0.15 Ω”。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4fe733845ebe3bd71a5c3a5a2806fc8e" id="4fe733845ebe3bd71a5c3a5a2806fc8e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137743-086e29df-a2f9-4e09-84a3-6f4dbcc8849f.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A629%2C%22height%22%3A160%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A774%2C%22originHeight%22%3A197%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b8c0d4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DpUq5%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="61cf14160d77aaa898dde5248d4eeddd" id="61cf14160d77aaa898dde5248d4eeddd" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4ba69796" id="u4ba69796" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3）三位有效数字电阻读法</span></p><p data-lake-id="52f9070dc4303c3423369d1441ae271d" id="52f9070dc4303c3423369d1441ae271d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3aa6d596" id="u3aa6d596" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">在电阻体上用四位数字来标明其阻值，一般用于±1% 精度的电阻。它的前3位为有效数字，第4位表示 在有效数字后面所加“0” 的个数，其中R表示小数点。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8c186d309e3843d520338fe87a92250f" id="8c186d309e3843d520338fe87a92250f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9cd2123f" id="u9cd2123f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如：“1001” 表示1000Ω。R500表示，0.5Ω（500mΩ）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="1ab32eb61294585210ce630f4120f94a" id="1ab32eb61294585210ce630f4120f94a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233137911-5bdcb2b1-f45a-492b-829b-9e9bb2bf2cf7.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A455%2C%22height%22%3A191%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A568%2C%22originHeight%22%3A238%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b0b1c3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Io5Az%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="5893728ea5832affa292a6f252b7c31e" id="5893728ea5832affa292a6f252b7c31e" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u98263742" id="u98263742" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">我们课程用的STM32F407板子，LED电路上的电阻为1000Ω：</span></p><p data-lake-id="f3c552e912598be6340f434aa98d2b22" id="f3c552e912598be6340f434aa98d2b22"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233138155-df523211-63a4-407a-b0a3-b36b84509134.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A324%2C%22height%22%3A274%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A695%2C%22originHeight%22%3A587%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23242927%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VRJim%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="3d8453ed77c11bc6ad46d667a9e9af7f" id="3d8453ed77c11bc6ad46d667a9e9af7f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u820f2efc" id="u820f2efc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">4）精密电阻读法</span></p><p data-lake-id="4f5855d5f4aa13b3230df92d7ca1049b" id="4f5855d5f4aa13b3230df92d7ca1049b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9c8b950f" id="u9c8b950f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">精密电阻读法是由两位数字加一位字母表示，一般用于为±0.1% 精度的电阻，字符是倍率。 例如：01B等。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7dedc000" id="u7dedc000" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">精密电阻阻值对照表：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="a89dd068910395751a21e18f6dd31a44" id="a89dd068910395751a21e18f6dd31a44"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233138451-a48e4abe-c7fc-4eb0-bd24-c76ee1d26f92.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A466%2C%22height%22%3A652%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1123%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1571%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sch4e%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="e578ed0c1fc3b2ef62f63090aa80df99" id="e578ed0c1fc3b2ef62f63090aa80df99"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233138730-553cd981-2f3e-4d9e-af62-4186bacc6c57.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A515%2C%22height%22%3A58%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1123%2C%22originHeight%22%3A126%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ERKPm%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="b7b4afc005ea369df8147e58785ea28b" id="b7b4afc005ea369df8147e58785ea28b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u91de6057" id="u91de6057" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如，01B表示100*10=1000Ω。</span></p><p data-lake-id="855d65069456ac1ab582fe79b86bca70" id="855d65069456ac1ab582fe79b86bca70"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233138922-557324b3-43bb-4808-9dd2-1f50aafa939d.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A301%2C%22height%22%3A243%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A361%2C%22originHeight%22%3A292%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c9c4d5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ODgDg%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="099ec5ec91e39bb2262f1672a473bf5d" id="099ec5ec91e39bb2262f1672a473bf5d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u1a0037c6" id="u1a0037c6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">5）色环法</span></p><p data-lake-id="4952e918ff55eddfbe9e176069874932" id="4952e918ff55eddfbe9e176069874932" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3b259bfd" id="u3b259bfd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">通过在电阻的体表涂上不同颜色的环带来表示电阻的阻值和精度。一般来说，电阻器上会有4个或5个 色环，每个色环代表一个数字或一个特定的系数。根据色环的位置和颜色可以确定电阻的阻值和精 度。</span></p><p data-lake-id="c592e7589fe7cab79b036af1a485cf96" id="c592e7589fe7cab79b036af1a485cf96"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233139147-d2b075ff-2ec3-4c6d-9caf-4b9699692a05.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A358%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A900%2C%22originHeight%22%3A713%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e1dcd8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GMPgn%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="45a3046aca71d92f15ca7e9ec7b621cb" id="45a3046aca71d92f15ca7e9ec7b621cb" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u685b43de" id="u685b43de" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">四环电阻的阻值：22*1±4% Ω。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7544d1fa530752a98d70b1b596a84cd2" id="7544d1fa530752a98d70b1b596a84cd2" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2ef3c967" id="u2ef3c967" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">五环电阻的阻值：220*100k±4% 。</span></p><p data-lake-id="aa76e9f8943567a703952dc8822a04a6" id="aa76e9f8943567a703952dc8822a04a6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucb2fd4a7" id="ucb2fd4a7" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：电阻阻值直接用万用表测量即可。一般很少读色环。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2c10f6c7" id="u2c10f6c7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4784841f" id="u4784841f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u25cb1bc7" id="u25cb1bc7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u38009245" id="u38009245" class="lake-fontsize-12">大招：</span></p><ul list="ubab3d102"><li fid="u2e6dda03" data-lake-id="u361c45ff" id="u361c45ff"><a href="https://lzltool.cn/four-resistor-calc" target="_blank" data-lake-id="ua18a1d62" id="ua18a1d62"><span data-lake-id="ue6831316" id="ue6831316" class="lake-fontsize-12">四色环电阻值计算器</span></a></li><li fid="u2e6dda03" data-lake-id="ufda6a68e" id="ufda6a68e"><a href="https://lzltool.cn/num-resistor-calc" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u3a4d7f7f" id="u3a4d7f7f"><span data-lake-id="ueeba8e7b" id="ueeba8e7b" class="lake-fontsize-12">数字标注电阻计算器</span></a></li><li fid="u2e6dda03" data-lake-id="u2ff4e972" id="u2ff4e972"><a href="https://www.tskau.com/component/shdzjsq" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u4823362b" id="u4823362b"><span data-lake-id="u1261bf88" id="u1261bf88" class="lake-fontsize-12">色环电阻在线计算器</span></a></li><li fid="u2e6dda03" data-lake-id="ub6bec212" id="ub6bec212"><a href="https://www.tskau.com/component/smdzz" target="_blank" data-lake-id="uf1baa0a6" id="uf1baa0a6"><span data-lake-id="u52cdeffa" id="u52cdeffa" class="lake-fontsize-12">SMD贴片电阻阻值计算器</span></a></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="gDheB" id="gDheB"><span data-lake-id="u5059fbf7" id="u5059fbf7">3.1.5 电阻在电路的一些应用</span></h3><p data-lake-id="56b4811be8046fb1eac90670b01440e0" id="56b4811be8046fb1eac90670b01440e0" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue9e9610d" id="ue9e9610d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">常用的电阻用法就不说了，大家应该很熟悉了，这里介绍一下上拉、下拉电阻：</span></p><p data-lake-id="cf3cb66ac896e36f90fa3768a9becbb2" id="cf3cb66ac896e36f90fa3768a9becbb2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc409c9b0" id="uc409c9b0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">上拉和下拉</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u04f46abd" id="u04f46abd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电阻统称为拉电阻。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u11f816f1" id="u11f816f1"><span data-lake-id="u6075907e" id="u6075907e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">在电子元器件中并不存在上拉电阻和下拉电阻这两种实体的电阻。 之所以这样称呼是根据电阻使用的场景不同来具体定义的。其本质还是电阻。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufbfdd05d" id="ufbfdd05d"><span data-lake-id="u091a1a7c" id="u091a1a7c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">上拉电阻是连接在信号线和电源（VCC）之间。当没有外部驱动时，电阻将信号线“拉”到高电平。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8621f869393f102ae0bbc37245ba2293" id="8621f869393f102ae0bbc37245ba2293" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub9df2c8d" id="ub9df2c8d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">下拉电阻是连接在信号线和地（GND）之间。当没有外部驱动时，电阻将信号线“拉”到低电平。</span></p><p data-lake-id="34ce11940af33207cf2a2ea8401e8b3c" id="34ce11940af33207cf2a2ea8401e8b3c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue77c0328" id="ue77c0328" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">总的来说，就是将不确定信号钳位在高电平（上拉）或者低电平（下拉）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6e86f9bd" id="u6e86f9bd" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u831ff8a2" id="u831ff8a2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">举个栗子：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufd856194" id="ufd856194" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub376e597" id="ub376e597" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">按钮/按键电路。当按键未按下时，上拉电阻确保MCU的输入引脚为高电平；当按键按下时，引脚被直接连接到GND，变为低电平。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3d870fd9" id="u3d870fd9" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783992146202-11a9bb85-94a3-4e8f-b360-c7ca2cf882d0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u132b62e7-2ee2-4db2-b461-a9d017ad78d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A342.5%2C%22height%22%3A179%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A40984%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A883%2C%22originHeight%22%3A461%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%2B5V%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20100%20100%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20HII%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A35%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2B5V%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A171%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A76%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A31%2C%22text%22%3A%22100%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A30%2C%22text%22%3A%22100%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A396%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A74%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A-26%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A371%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%22HII%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua7d42bee%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u09689ac1" id="u09689ac1" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u46fc10fa" id="u46fc10fa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">限流：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue91c1f88" id="ue91c1f88" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua0df3131" id="ua0df3131" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000"> LED 灯串联限流电阻，如果没有这个电阻，LED会因电流过大而瞬间损坏。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucd4b3327" id="ucd4b3327" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783991991221-3c65bc6f-6a8d-42ec-a206-5c0cea5eecff.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4d3384ab-8b21-4706-80bb-4491e052151%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A264%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A384%2C%22originHeight%22%3A572%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2b50290a%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7079804a" id="u7079804a" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u473a9938" id="u473a9938">分压：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u33203515" id="u33203515" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9102912b" id="u9102912b">当两个电阻串联时，根据欧姆定律，电流会在每个电阻上产生电压降。总电压会按电阻值的比例分配在两个电阻上。这就构成了一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf6401e1" id="ubf6401e1">分压器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1daa9135" id="u1daa9135">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud46fa014" id="ud46fa014" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7992a0dd" id="u7992a0dd">例子：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u402a6c7b" id="u402a6c7b"> 为芯片提供特定的参考电压。 在传感器电路中（如热敏电阻），将物理量的变化（电阻变化）转换为电压变化，以便单片机读取。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2dc9c845" id="u2dc9c845" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783992916241-dff4b658-5036-4697-b428-83910a04822f.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u25c7d1c4-5de8-429b-a62f-d0888cdf455%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A347%2C%22height%22%3A240%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1264%2C%22originHeight%22%3A876%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue9e7d242%22%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783992916377-989eea62-da03-43ab-8e27-423b1dfdf483.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4d575838-7ab1-48f5-aded-0eb7db5ce13%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A377%2C%22height%22%3A243%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1052%2C%22originHeight%22%3A678%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua987c86e%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u77cf5ce2" id="u77cf5ce2" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a88654c" id="u3a88654c">能耗与发热描述：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua0b50e4e" id="ua0b50e4e"> 当电流流过电阻时，电能会以热的形式消耗掉。这通常是一种无用的损耗，但在某些场合下可以被利用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u668e6a9c" id="u668e6a9c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uaeae1291" id="uaeae1291">无用：导致电源效率降低。 </span></p><p data-lake-id="u841b38df" id="u841b38df" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20b3f346" id="u20b3f346">有用：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua0fd32df" id="ua0fd32df"> 电热丝、电炉、电烙铁、电水壶等都是利用电阻发热原理工作的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud7d64fa1" id="ud7d64fa1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u433dae54" id="u433dae54">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u586f4295" id="u586f4295" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2b8ab69" id="uc2b8ab69">如何选择？</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u193e06f5" id="u193e06f5" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8f29054" id="ue8f29054">限流电阻选择</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u697e166a" id="u697e166a"><span data-lake-id="u3d293cf8" id="u3d293cf8">LED期望工作电流（小功率LED通常5-20mA）</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua1ff1260" id="ua1ff1260" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783993369830-5ca457b0-7b07-431c-93f2-dee934df1beb.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4121d3b3-a2a1-42f7-b73e-dd09de83dd1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A283%2C%22height%22%3A188%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1258%2C%22originHeight%22%3A834%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua0f36701%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uda8b94ca" id="uda8b94ca" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u16f61e0e" id="u16f61e0e">5V电源驱动普通LED：(5V−2V)/0.01A=300Ω ，常用 100Ω，220Ω， 330Ω， 470Ω。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1f706f90" id="u1f706f90" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ufca0c647" id="ufca0c647">FYI:LED正向压降（通常红/黄/绿：1.8-2.2V， 蓝/白：3.0-3.4V）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3738766d" id="u3738766d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a89ff81" id="u7a89ff81">分压电路电阻选择</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3e637d65" id="u3e637d65" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783993369785-7dd2df64-5784-48f8-8c35-71ad76a222f4.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud5a11e81-1a41-4332-a6a0-9939e3ff9f2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A332%2C%22height%22%3A214%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1052%2C%22originHeight%22%3A678%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udf44c437%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u22a7d789" id="u22a7d789"><span data-lake-id="uf8c760e9" id="uf8c760e9">为了在采样速度和功耗间取得平衡，常用 1kΩ - 100kΩ 范围。例如上方图是</span><code data-lake-id="u9832621e" id="u9832621e"><span data-lake-id="u5ee8008e" id="u5ee8008e">10kΩ</span></code><span data-lake-id="udc0ef772" id="udc0ef772"> 是常见的二分压配置。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue8846d0b" id="ue8846d0b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f90e261" id="u2f90e261">上拉/下拉电阻</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ufb12d414" id="ufb12d414"><span data-lake-id="ub7b3d9b8" id="ub7b3d9b8">用于确定数字信号线（I2C， GPIO， Reset引脚）在无主动驱动时的逻辑状态。</span></p><ul list="u9468049f"><li fid="u39d80d39" data-lake-id="ue010e51f" id="ue010e51f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u69e3943d" id="u69e3943d">选择要点：在功耗和速度间折衷。</span></li></ul><ul list="u9468049f" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u2871898e" data-lake-id="u96b432c3" id="u96b432c3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u6cc63988" id="u6cc63988">强上拉（低阻值）：如1kΩ， 4.7kΩ。提供更强驱动能力，抗干扰好，但功耗大，总线负载重。</span></li><li fid="u2871898e" data-lake-id="u909b94c7" id="u909b94c7" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub89fa3cc" id="ub89fa3cc">弱上拉（高阻值）：如10kΩ， 100kΩ。功耗低，但边沿速度慢，易受噪声影响。</span></li></ul><ul list="u9468049f" start="2"><li fid="u39d80d39" data-lake-id="uf629f066" id="uf629f066" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u7fd0911c" id="u7fd0911c">典型值：</span></li></ul><ul list="u9468049f" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u2eaf0acd" data-lake-id="u651e6848" id="u651e6848" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3b1c18fd" id="u3b1c18fd">GPIO、复位引脚：10kΩ 是一个非常通用和经典的值。</span></li><li fid="u2eaf0acd" data-lake-id="u42c8a939" id="u42c8a939" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u56123619" id="u56123619">I2C总线：标准模式（100kHz）常用 4.7kΩ；快速模式（400kHz）常用 2.2kΩ。</span></li><li fid="u2eaf0acd" data-lake-id="u7e8e7a61" id="u7e8e7a61" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub6c74cdd" id="ub6c74cdd">按键/开关下拉：常用 1kΩ - 10kΩ。10kΩ最常用。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="u3Kyc" id="u3Kyc"><span data-lake-id="u8019b56d" id="u8019b56d">3.2 电容器</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="LIhDi" id="LIhDi"><span data-lake-id="u64f4dced" id="u64f4dced">3.2.1 电容概念</span></h3><p data-lake-id="13541d1c2c7880f6311ffd8ef511b63d" id="13541d1c2c7880f6311ffd8ef511b63d"><span data-lake-id="u88ca301f" id="u88ca301f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容是一种被用来存储电荷和电能的被动电子元件。它由两个导体之间的非导体介质隔开而形成，这 个介质可以是空气、塑料或其他绝缘体。电容器的主要特性是其电容值，用法拉（Farad，简写为F） 来表示,1F代表升压1V可以储存1C电量。电容器的电容值决定了其存储电荷的能力--》</span><span style="color: #000000"><u><span data-lake-id="uca33c285" id="uca33c285" class="lake-fontsize-12">稳压</span></u></span><span data-lake-id="ud1931df6" id="ud1931df6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="62e83683c087de55155de4a2f50871e1" id="62e83683c087de55155de4a2f50871e1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ubd46eb67" id="ubd46eb67" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1F 法拉= 10^3毫法（mF）= 10^6微法（uF）= 10^9纳法（nF）=10^12皮法（pF）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ca4330e2b45f44f9d30d5663848af6b9" id="ca4330e2b45f44f9d30d5663848af6b9"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233139472-30d8200a-03d0-400b-b265-e1069f357b5e.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A363%2C%22height%22%3A345%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A452%2C%22originHeight%22%3A429%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23484b48%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T3e02%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="0d1a3cf45f63b393564832be2a4be712" id="0d1a3cf45f63b393564832be2a4be712"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233139643-42ffc7b6-a9d0-4113-81ca-5eb52ddea6c9.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A481%2C%22height%22%3A219%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A816%2C%22originHeight%22%3A372%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23949593%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fVmVp%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud4702a4f" id="ud4702a4f"><span data-lake-id="u8c7df779" id="u8c7df779" class="lake-fontsize-12">原理图：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ube856442" id="ube856442"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783993621172-23b80e57-9a23-4b77-8997-1bb2e4e97be1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u725e4d39-8bb0-4acd-83ef-d202639ab75%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A467.5%2C%22height%22%3A185%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87356%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A935%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%2292929%2062629%20C2%20C1%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E6%97%A0%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E5%B8%A6%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A485%2C%22y%22%3A-7%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%2292929%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A-8%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A56%2C%22text%22%3A%2262629%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A694%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A49%2C%22text%22%3A%22C2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%22C1%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A160%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A78%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A295%2C%22height%22%3A66%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%97%A0%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A614%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A290%2C%22height%22%3A58%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B8%A6%E6%9E%81%E6%80%A7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefbf7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u865dbfec%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="RW9ra" id="RW9ra"><span data-lake-id="u27d4d5eb" id="u27d4d5eb">3.2.2 电容性质</span></h3><p data-lake-id="97e874f53a2c8e5c422e0e375b9aa1fe" id="97e874f53a2c8e5c422e0e375b9aa1fe" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufacd4a4a" id="ufacd4a4a" class="lake-fontsize-12">电容器的基本性质一：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua7587c7b" id="ua7587c7b" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7631bf1b" id="u7631bf1b" class="lake-fontsize-12">积蓄电荷</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3f97c9a3" id="u3f97c9a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span></p><p data-lake-id="da89aa39f2d4cced7e602b2c094cabd4" id="da89aa39f2d4cced7e602b2c094cabd4"><span data-lake-id="u6eac3ab4" id="u6eac3ab4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容器也被称为蓄电器，顾名思义，就是通过采用大面积的电极构造以及高电容率的电介质，从而 能够蓄积大量电荷。接通电源施加直流电压，则电流瞬间流向导线，对电容器进行充电；当电极间的 电位差与电源电压相等，则电流不再流动，充电结束。充放电过程如下图所示。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ec6e26e1fc5c0d2422982f5ead686d1d" id="ec6e26e1fc5c0d2422982f5ead686d1d"><span data-lake-id="ubfe81094" id="ubfe81094" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="7ced08894fd0a69045af1ba5239ef9d7" id="7ced08894fd0a69045af1ba5239ef9d7"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233139833-10db78d4-1164-4bfc-afb8-2f6ee4258276.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A537%2C%22height%22%3A232%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A697%2C%22originHeight%22%3A301%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ja2Nr%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="6ae28bd16a8de2a3b8d181a91ef5e697" id="6ae28bd16a8de2a3b8d181a91ef5e697" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6220350" id="ub6220350" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">充电过程：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="b554aa843e226529e96ca0ccfdfb4e6a" id="b554aa843e226529e96ca0ccfdfb4e6a"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u363d4dfa" id="u363d4dfa"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028327761-453b4776-9e5a-4ead-a976-78471c541c7c.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A501%2C%22height%22%3A316%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A858%2C%22originHeight%22%3A542%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9fd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qP0HH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="506250bfe7621ecc0e8a2633dd1e5b8b" id="506250bfe7621ecc0e8a2633dd1e5b8b" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e1b7c29" id="u4e1b7c29" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">放电过程：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="383fc7298f31ae1f545c6606b6eb8fba" id="383fc7298f31ae1f545c6606b6eb8fba"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028338119-45259e76-f9cc-422f-a51c-c687a21fb5cf.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A464%2C%22height%22%3A293%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A858%2C%22originHeight%22%3A542%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafe%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wrBgy%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uca8b5f88" id="uca8b5f88"><span data-lake-id="ua84e05e5" id="ua84e05e5" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="84e68f2449f8a51f928a40b00d0143a5" id="84e68f2449f8a51f928a40b00d0143a5" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2709587c" id="u2709587c" class="lake-fontsize-12">电容器的基本性质二：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue429e1ad" id="ue429e1ad" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub955e427" id="ub955e427" class="lake-fontsize-12">阻直流，通交流</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc4560673" id="uc4560673" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span></p><p data-lake-id="34fff35dc8129f4466721e5beddf55b8" id="34fff35dc8129f4466721e5beddf55b8" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue2e2e9f8" id="ue2e2e9f8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容器的电极被电介质阻隔，施加直流电压后，电流不会流到电介质的内部，电容器具有阻断直流的 性质。</span></p><p data-lake-id="accd76ce44799adf603431d6ed22bfde" id="accd76ce44799adf603431d6ed22bfde" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2ca2b36f" id="u2ca2b36f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">连接交流电源，则电极板周期性地反复进行充电与放电，电场方向也会相应地发生改变，其实不是电荷真的通过了极板，而是通过极板的不断的充电和放电，对外电路来说就有了电流。</span></p><p data-lake-id="caade2aa431302632a94880e1c24d18d" id="caade2aa431302632a94880e1c24d18d"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uad9df8eb" id="uad9df8eb"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028354856-4a560a72-2428-4967-9e4d-818bfa346f98.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A554%2C%22height%22%3A203%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1512%2C%22originHeight%22%3A554%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GZU6B%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="9e8fa0bfc89e866358dfd834c3d168b7" id="9e8fa0bfc89e866358dfd834c3d168b7" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b66c31f" id="u6b66c31f" class="lake-fontsize-12">电容器的基本性质三：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubeedee82" id="ubeedee82" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f5bd548" id="u1f5bd548" class="lake-fontsize-12">频率越高，电容量越大，交流电越容易通过</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua656a052" id="ua656a052" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;</span></p><p data-lake-id="848b113015c77bbe868311cb5e46df4f" id="848b113015c77bbe868311cb5e46df4f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4cce5d2f" id="u4cce5d2f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">&quot;阻直流，通交流&quot;是电容器的基本性质。但并非所有交流电都一样通过，通过的阻碍由交流电的频率与 电容器的电容量决定。该交流电通过阻碍叫做容抗(Xc)。是电容器对交流电的阻抗，单位是欧姆[Ω]。</span></p><p data-lake-id="e01203dafffda4c63239de1ab55b8c66" id="e01203dafffda4c63239de1ab55b8c66"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028369550-660660b6-68d4-4148-9f86-ad4af4770a56.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A318%2C%22height%22%3A399%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A702%2C%22originHeight%22%3A880%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Th7zV%22%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028378050-1588c3ef-ce88-479e-94cb-686957491206.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A350%2C%22height%22%3A439%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A702%2C%22originHeight%22%3A880%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qj6eO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u32a47848" id="u32a47848"><br></p><p data-lake-id="3614e7a1344f511f0511254967117ead" id="3614e7a1344f511f0511254967117ead" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue78122f8" id="ue78122f8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容耐压值：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="259c53008ace4d221493b50778aa6543" id="259c53008ace4d221493b50778aa6543"><span data-lake-id="ub9033649" id="ub9033649" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容耐压值是指电容器能够承受的最大值，比如一个标称耐压为100V的电容，如果是用在10V的电路 中，那么这个电容承受的电压就是10V，如果是用在100V电路中，这个电容承受的电压就是100V，但 这个电容就只能承受最大100V的电压，否则就会损坏。</span></p><p data-lake-id="41909413f95e4c7469ba06015547feef" id="41909413f95e4c7469ba06015547feef"><span data-lake-id="uaffb5f4b" id="uaffb5f4b" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="XuPk6" id="XuPk6"><span data-lake-id="u705b9122" id="u705b9122">3.2.3 固定电容</span></h3><p data-lake-id="3a7f45a6394bb216068d576daba3327f" id="3a7f45a6394bb216068d576daba3327f"><span data-lake-id="uba996c80" id="uba996c80" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">无极性电容和有极性电容都可以看作固定电容，两者的主要差异是容量和对于电容两端极性要求不 同。无极性电容对于两端极性没有要求，但一般容量较小，可以用于交流电。极性电容造价便宜，容 量大，只能用于直流电场景(提前确定极性)。</span></p><p data-lake-id="a7678dc9f0f75b33ac6f26ba54d87079" id="a7678dc9f0f75b33ac6f26ba54d87079" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ub47ac948" id="ub47ac948" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">固定电容按照工艺区分，电解电容（有极性）、瓷片电容，主要就是在价格和容量间做取舍。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua0151c73" id="ua0151c73" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u6ef2c23c" id="u6ef2c23c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">像一些无极电容：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucea302a0" id="ucea302a0" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783993562431-a6c1a711-1f25-4b15-bb86-94ea29ea261b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8ea4ed89-b5fe-4382-9ef4-b069d0ddb7c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A790.5%2C%22height%22%3A189%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A335824%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1581%2C%22originHeight%22%3A378%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%2262626%20%E7%93%B7%E7%89%87%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E5%8F%AF%E8%B0%83%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E9%99%B6%E7%93%B7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E8%96%84%E8%86%9C%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A1167%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A52%2C%22text%22%3A%2262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A526%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A37%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E7%93%B7%E7%89%87%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1366%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A36%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%AF%E8%B0%83%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A37%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E9%99%B6%E7%93%B7%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A946%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A34%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%96%84%E8%86%9C%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f2f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u82b40db8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="e1d3504cd9b99f9171c97bab65b472d0" id="e1d3504cd9b99f9171c97bab65b472d0" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8cea80d8" id="u8cea80d8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u35b069ac" id="u35b069ac" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）电解电容</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="9a9b97778203c3423eec196a60398f4f" id="9a9b97778203c3423eec196a60398f4f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud7571f27" id="ud7571f27" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span></p><p data-lake-id="5e76152b82d3f49f52fd7651bc9d6915" id="5e76152b82d3f49f52fd7651bc9d6915" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2849c71b" id="u2849c71b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">直插电容：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/505121.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u807c3b16" id="u807c3b16"><span data-lake-id="u9017350d" id="u9017350d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/505121.html</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="76e97c848458a191449af11b61b6c3a3" id="76e97c848458a191449af11b61b6c3a3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc694593c" id="uc694593c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">贴片电容：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/3062332.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u0fd6703c" id="u0fd6703c"><span data-lake-id="uddd53cbc" id="uddd53cbc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/3062332.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u248be8db" id="u248be8db" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ca4191def69b75a465dfc88bf8b49926" id="ca4191def69b75a465dfc88bf8b49926" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9312f9e4" id="u9312f9e4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">应用场景：储能、电源滤波</span></p><p data-lake-id="6fe07db344d0094a95c032d31bdee3f4" id="6fe07db344d0094a95c032d31bdee3f4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233141202-306c1932-21fc-496e-8093-429f03701f52.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A524%2C%22height%22%3A373%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A731%2C%22originHeight%22%3A520%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%239c9d36%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZTX2b%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="11d14a565018464ac26cc4b4afbf107e" id="11d14a565018464ac26cc4b4afbf107e" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="udeeff2dd" id="udeeff2dd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电解电容的正负极识别：</span></p><p data-lake-id="973e671ac5b4016161c49cc25cfad2cb" id="973e671ac5b4016161c49cc25cfad2cb"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233141436-42bf2c39-8cfe-47f7-8415-7be4095f829b.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A515%2C%22height%22%3A186%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A680%2C%22originHeight%22%3A245%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2391a0b4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uq8fq%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="4da71823fb1d33d813436b2214162aa8" id="4da71823fb1d33d813436b2214162aa8" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0cd1867e" id="u0cd1867e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ac9f021" id="u0ac9f021" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）瓷片电容</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="a48af3a83dbb49685466136e5ffed676" id="a48af3a83dbb49685466136e5ffed676" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u088c0727" id="u088c0727" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/2990644.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u16e35578" id="u16e35578"><span data-lake-id="u1fc5f01a" id="u1fc5f01a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/2990644.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u0d93730f" id="u0d93730f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ab9574460fc11679843f8e8d78595067" id="ab9574460fc11679843f8e8d78595067"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233141630-c5b03b5e-ffea-4785-938c-0d508810f092.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A588%2C%22height%22%3A168%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A993%2C%22originHeight%22%3A284%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a6a634%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NiyZ6%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="gPVbh" id="gPVbh"><span data-lake-id="ubca343a4" id="ubca343a4">3.2.4 其他电容</span></h3><p data-lake-id="udaac3359" id="udaac3359"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783993491412-4a5fa575-9492-447c-8f92-f34a8365bd84.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7db6cf61-13d3-4709-860e-3c55e8e0887%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A817%2C%22height%22%3A168%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A607659%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1634%2C%22originHeight%22%3A335%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E9%93%9D%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%A3%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E5%9B%BA%E6%80%81%E9%93%9D%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E6%B3%95%E6%8B%89%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%20%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E5%9D%A6%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A234%2C%22height%22%3A38%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E9%93%9D%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%A3%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A496%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A38%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E5%9B%BA%E6%80%81%E9%93%9D%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1390%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A33%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B3%95%E6%8B%89%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A953%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A34%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%B4%E7%89%87%E5%9D%A6%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0e9cd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u44426897%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="0e095c47e3728cd054698fea935e82c3" id="0e095c47e3728cd054698fea935e82c3" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8e169d14" id="u8e169d14" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">可变电容：可变电容和固定电容工艺类似，但是一般有一个调节装置可以调节两个极片之间的相对面 积，从而达到调节电容大小的目的。一般很少使用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8e216ba409ab6b5ba132797e3e663c86" id="8e216ba409ab6b5ba132797e3e663c86"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233141830-bc89420a-adcc-4add-bafa-21387ae91431.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A293%2C%22height%22%3A202%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A361%2C%22originHeight%22%3A249%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b9aa97%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aDYF9%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="e1970c75378944b16af8781ff79d781f" id="e1970c75378944b16af8781ff79d781f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3f305ffa" id="u3f305ffa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/178893.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u6386b1c3" id="u6386b1c3"><span data-lake-id="u3463e1d4" id="u3463e1d4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/178893.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="u0e9069f3" id="u0e9069f3" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="9d04621d78ba4fae51924f17a5f59809" id="9d04621d78ba4fae51924f17a5f59809"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233142021-1c12b32a-a9db-4ab4-981a-2815656e9ede.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A520%2C%22height%22%3A192%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A799%2C%22originHeight%22%3A295%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23baba6a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R0ixI%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="e21f35441e3e15d457a7470c0a3b7082" id="e21f35441e3e15d457a7470c0a3b7082"><span data-lake-id="ub7dd9554" id="ub7dd9554" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">超级电容：一种特殊的电容，介于传统电容器和电池之间，容量大，充电快，可以反复充放电，一般 用于汽车领域、备用电源领域、风力发电领域等。比如：电路中电源突然断电，可以通过超级电容给 后续电路瞬间提供电压，保证系统有时间切换到备用电源上。</span></p><p data-lake-id="55d45e6d3caeb4ecfd66e7b61cb3fee5" id="55d45e6d3caeb4ecfd66e7b61cb3fee5"><span data-lake-id="uff978a2a" id="uff978a2a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="41e25e1b5bc0fe6cf2631e536ed2ec91" id="41e25e1b5bc0fe6cf2631e536ed2ec91"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233142195-a06cb337-d8a7-439b-873b-f4826565dc97.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A374%2C%22height%22%3A355%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A512%2C%22originHeight%22%3A486%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23474d48%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SIjrM%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="wE3eA" id="wE3eA"><span data-lake-id="uff214663" id="uff214663">3.2.5 电容的容量识别</span></h3><p data-lake-id="483542118f5420ca096609cee5067d77" id="483542118f5420ca096609cee5067d77" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uccd1eaf4" id="uccd1eaf4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电容F的单位容量非常大，所以我们看到的电容一般都是mF、uF、nF、pF的单位。 1F=10^3mF=10^6uF=10^9nF=10^12pF</span></p><p data-lake-id="35f60e8738e76c92318a879925d5e25d" id="35f60e8738e76c92318a879925d5e25d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0f03ebfb" id="u0f03ebfb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uabb7c8e4" id="uabb7c8e4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）直接标注法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="1f4b3fd382a0e12d1e054d3cc09afb73" id="1f4b3fd382a0e12d1e054d3cc09afb73" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5d29a225" id="u5d29a225" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">般电解电容表面直接显示的容值就是实际的容值，例如0.01uF、0.047uF、33pF、45pF。下图的电解 电容容值为1500uF。</span></p><p data-lake-id="f7120547b8cfb2a33c7b1046dd1c8206" id="f7120547b8cfb2a33c7b1046dd1c8206"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233142371-1197fad0-3844-48d0-98d0-a1e94a230b1d.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A208%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A318%2C%22originHeight%22%3A251%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23878097%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m9xrp%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="29ace64d4b1136fd2cc453370a60a1df" id="29ace64d4b1136fd2cc453370a60a1df" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3989b054" id="u3989b054" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u82cd040a" id="u82cd040a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）乘方数表示法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="30e85b3fd0d77f58738d5bbd9734aed6" id="30e85b3fd0d77f58738d5bbd9734aed6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2323affa" id="u2323affa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">一般陶瓷电容用三位数字表示容值。它的首位和二位为有效数字，第三位表示在有效数字后面所加“0”  的个数。拼接完的容值单位是pF。</span></p><p data-lake-id="74a4b8304bc7f4e631b8d29e7349389c" id="74a4b8304bc7f4e631b8d29e7349389c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u1e436a9d" id="u1e436a9d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">100      10*100= 10pF</span></p><p data-lake-id="1292ee2870d87f646dcc3d7625f27604" id="1292ee2870d87f646dcc3d7625f27604" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ued7ca200" id="ued7ca200" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">101      10*101= 100pF</span></p><p data-lake-id="299e8ef6e616a3dedc71b385d8e4c46a" id="299e8ef6e616a3dedc71b385d8e4c46a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3e2a9e7f" id="u3e2a9e7f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">102      10*102= 1000pF = 1nF</span></p><p data-lake-id="111bc33d218e3649bcb7ecd89607bc26" id="111bc33d218e3649bcb7ecd89607bc26" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua8228d78" id="ua8228d78" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">103      10*103= 10000pF = 10nF</span></p><p data-lake-id="51b9b24ebe75fd235a3546b6bfc2c9eb" id="51b9b24ebe75fd235a3546b6bfc2c9eb" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u644006ab" id="u644006ab" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">104      10*104= 100000pF = 100nF</span></p><p data-lake-id="b60781d0c4a662cf779f58700ffaa7ba" id="b60781d0c4a662cf779f58700ffaa7ba" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u19aedf13" id="u19aedf13" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">105      10*105= 1000000pF = 1000nF = 1uF</span></p><p data-lake-id="d2e8a29c05cd20a3d74a8ea4f6178589" id="d2e8a29c05cd20a3d74a8ea4f6178589"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233142558-4d5fdb2d-13d6-4f43-a0e7-e78686a231f3.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A339%2C%22height%22%3A230%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A403%2C%22originHeight%22%3A274%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bfcde4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VUZyh%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="866e710437353e13c384c91c88eda6a0" id="866e710437353e13c384c91c88eda6a0" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u523d50aa" id="u523d50aa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc43b422e" id="uc43b422e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）贴片电解电容</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="952148058611550832a31ededf2ef30c" id="952148058611550832a31ededf2ef30c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u2cdc7588" id="u2cdc7588" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">贴片电解电容，上表示的数字就直接读取，单位是uF。例如下图中的470表示470uF。</span></p><p data-lake-id="76f6d9354c68f416b8a32048a092bb2a" id="76f6d9354c68f416b8a32048a092bb2a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233142734-a5681460-a602-497e-a4aa-bf86291d9d48.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A256%2C%22height%22%3A300%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A320%2C%22originHeight%22%3A375%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b1b3c4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qRrsc%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="rH228" id="rH228"><span data-lake-id="u069409ed" id="u069409ed">3.2.6 电容的应用</span></h3><p data-lake-id="273cbecf2c19bbb9580e8fd1368f1996" id="273cbecf2c19bbb9580e8fd1368f1996" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="udd91d073" id="udd91d073" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">单片机上电的瞬间到稳定供电，会产生很多杂波，可以将杂波过滤掉，比如我们的STM32开发板。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubd60496a" id="ubd60496a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud565f47f" id="ud565f47f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">滤波：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8524e44c" id="u8524e44c" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8ae2b4e" id="ub8ae2b4e">作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u94bd4a3c" id="u94bd4a3c">：平滑电压，去除杂波 </span></p><p data-lake-id="ub7190e75" id="ub7190e75" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="uadc18b1a" id="uadc18b1a">例子：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua05e490e" id="ua05e490e">电源旁边的大电容 → 稳定电压，芯片旁边的小电容 → 去除高频噪声</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub3ddf8f1" id="ub3ddf8f1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783993685056-320f78f7-2c59-4b88-bfd3-dcd6f9a12d1d.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3b6627cb-b7fc-4939-935a-cb426867066%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uba0f9c96-9975-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A533%2C%22height%22%3A198%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2166%2C%22originHeight%22%3A806%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue108e895%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u06d87325" id="u06d87325" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u109a0b38" id="u109a0b38">低通滤波</span></p><p data-lake-id="udcdedf5d" id="udcdedf5d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u31500863" id="u31500863">耦合</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f4ab1c8" id="u3f4ab1c8">作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u795ac63c" id="u795ac63c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">：传递交流信号，阻断直流 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f5aeefc" id="u7f5aeefc">例子</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9090bf43" id="u9090bf43" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">：音频设备中传递声音信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud0be5eba" id="ud0be5eba"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783994030572-69af2168-01d8-4758-afbf-4fe02937a39e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucc5bfb9f-dc71-4f41-8234-b6452514be9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uadbec587-e83d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A632%2C%22height%22%3A280%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A109174%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1562%2C%22originHeight%22%3A693%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22OUT%2065.2HZ%2010UF%20211-1%2035%20%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9A%E6%BB%A4%E6%B3%A2%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A1226%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22OUT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A390%2C%22y%22%3A108%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A26%2C%22text%22%3A%2265.2HZ%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A669%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A25%2C%22text%22%3A%2210UF%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A330%2C%22height%22%3A70%2C%22text%22%3A%22211-1%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A909%2C%22y%22%3A319%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A26%2C%22text%22%3A%2235%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A-5%2C%22y%22%3A379%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A66%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A409%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A77%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1309%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A76%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A639%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A31%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9A%E6%BB%A4%E6%B3%A2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A188%2C%22y%22%3A605%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A72%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1088%2C%22y%22%3A604%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubd4e2b07%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0caeed2b" id="u0caeed2b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7924f742" id="u7924f742">储能</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8d7c00e" id="ue8d7c00e">作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u370e656e" id="u370e656e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">：短时间内提供大电流 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6597d9d" id="ub6597d9d">例子</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5877f3fc" id="u5877f3fc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">：相机闪光灯、电机启动</span></p><p data-lake-id="u633c4e8b" id="u633c4e8b" style="text-align: left"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u82aded70" id="u82aded70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u50adb462" id="u50adb462">常见各类场景的容值选择：</span></strong></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%220.1%CE%BCF%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E5%8E%BB%E8%80%A6%5Cn10%CE%BCF%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E6%BB%A4%E6%B3%A2%5Cn100%CE%BCF%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%A7%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E6%BB%A4%E6%B3%A2%5Cn1nF%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%5Cn10pF%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E7%94%B5%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zZJ4R%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u72803df8" id="u72803df8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73ec2798" id="u73ec2798">电容值单位换算</span></strong></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%95%E6%8B%89(F)%5Cn1%E6%B3%95%E6%8B%89(F)%20%3D%201%2C000%E6%AF%AB%E6%B3%95(mF)%5Cn1%E6%AF%AB%E6%B3%95(mF)%20%3D%201%2C000%E5%BE%AE%E6%B3%95(%CE%BCF)%5Cn1%E5%BE%AE%E6%B3%95(%CE%BCF)%20%3D%201%2C000%E7%BA%B3%E6%B3%95(nF)%5Cn1%E7%BA%B3%E6%B3%95(nF)%20%3D%201%2C000%E7%9A%AE%E6%B3%95(pF)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bqnXW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="A2T9P" id="A2T9P"><span data-lake-id="uee8a59ac" id="uee8a59ac">3.3 电感器</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="g2lUD" id="g2lUD"><span data-lake-id="u952e478e" id="u952e478e">3.3.1 电感概念</span></h3><p data-lake-id="613da183dab3f507da13cb1a9273038d" id="613da183dab3f507da13cb1a9273038d" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud93c1af2" id="ud93c1af2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电感是一种电子元件，也被称为线圈或电感器。它是由导线或线圈绕成的，通常以磁场的形式来储存和释放磁能量。电感的主要特性是它对电流变化的抵抗能力，即电感会阻碍电流的变化----&gt;</span><span style="color: #000000"><u><span data-lake-id="u4c1520c0" id="u4c1520c0" class="lake-fontsize-12">稳流</span></u></span><span data-lake-id="u084d7862" id="u084d7862" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="1077f44b6e6f9a94800850685805f76e" id="1077f44b6e6f9a94800850685805f76e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233144040-820b26eb-0b9c-4d52-addb-5a3c0dac7d89.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A405%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A633%2C%22originHeight%22%3A440%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23808c81%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyDfu%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783995682478-06d07ea7-6ebb-4f5b-804a-6fcf3a24f6ea.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u74acd6f2-82bd-421f-8b22-f71788be395%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A183%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A30171%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A428%2C%22originHeight%22%3A297%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22L1%20MS%2010UH%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A178%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A47%2C%22text%22%3A%22L1%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A-80%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A453%2C%22height%22%3A112%2C%22text%22%3A%22MS%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A46%2C%22text%22%3A%2210UH%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf2ee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u40e151e3%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="bacc21f2a481ba668401d9eb7213d704" id="bacc21f2a481ba668401d9eb7213d704" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue25134c4" id="ue25134c4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电感对直流电流没有阻碍作用，对交流电流阻碍作用大。电感的单位为亨（H），也是一个很大的 单位，我们常用的电感级别都是mH或者uH。</span></p><p data-lake-id="a22ce4da59f15a47a1943723cd019579" id="a22ce4da59f15a47a1943723cd019579" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u87c9bb17" id="u87c9bb17" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电感的换算单位：1H = 10^3mH；1mH = 10^3uH。</span></p><p data-lake-id="19fe44b1a5ca539b2212df49956b0aee" id="19fe44b1a5ca539b2212df49956b0aee" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u444d6282" id="u444d6282" class="lake-fontsize-12">对于我们玩弱电的嵌入式工程师来说，了解电感的两个作用即可：</span></p><p data-lake-id="dd7dbea26d3a9033f393d975d7272b76" id="dd7dbea26d3a9033f393d975d7272b76" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uadede967" id="uadede967" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1）电感储能</span></p><p data-lake-id="2822e8f1baf8c26ac7c7878b0b89b83b" id="2822e8f1baf8c26ac7c7878b0b89b83b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u7416fb84" id="u7416fb84" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电感以磁场的方式储存电能。电流流过电感时，会在其周围建立磁场，从而储存能量。当外部电路试图切断电流时，它会释放储存的能量以维持电流。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6e4f2923" id="u6e4f2923" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8551d433" id="u8551d433" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如;开关电源（DC-DC变换器）中，电感在开关管导通时储存能量，在开关管关断时向负载释放能量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4e8ae9cd9c130c7346fa7ac034259947" id="4e8ae9cd9c130c7346fa7ac034259947"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fgif%2F45508326%2F1733028856102-14e8e3d5-c601-4e6a-8724-23db67979002.gif%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A523%2C%22height%22%3A306%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1502%2C%22originHeight%22%3A878%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7fe%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AgZ0B%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u310118e2" id="u310118e2" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u810c8b56" id="u810c8b56" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="22a6a4c9a020b5092269d29d5185c537" id="22a6a4c9a020b5092269d29d5185c537" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u88ef183e" id="u88ef183e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2）电感通直隔交,阻高频，通低频</span></p><p data-lake-id="fc2040ca59f56ff3ce3be6ed81003810" id="fc2040ca59f56ff3ce3be6ed81003810" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9f409d0e" id="u9f409d0e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">电感对交流电的阻抗随频率升高而增加。因此，在电路中，电感可以阻挡高频噪声，而让直流和低频信号顺利通过。</span></p><p data-lake-id="aea70835ad797f2439043a7604213638" id="aea70835ad797f2439043a7604213638"><span data-lake-id="u5cb46a92" id="u5cb46a92" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如：在电源线上串联一个小电感，用于滤除高频开关噪声。</span></p><p data-lake-id="25a2b3730dea6ba678fa813b01f66857" id="25a2b3730dea6ba678fa813b01f66857"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233145088-48f5dd05-500a-4a0c-a105-dfc01fb8cd82.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A411%2C%22height%22%3A260%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A994%2C%22originHeight%22%3A629%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a6dba2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ErDCq%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u476cc8f5" id="u476cc8f5"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783995923358-b3ba1c59-8738-4ee5-9065-f316e2bca071.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uaf675ad9-b005-45dc-bdbd-d1df456cc75%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A749%2C%22height%22%3A229%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A112722%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1498%2C%22originHeight%22%3A457%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2626%20MAX736.208MV%20MAX5V%202.8KHZ%2065.5MH%20%E5%87%BA%2035%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A983%2C%22y%22%3A-2%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A59%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A46%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A-3%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A61%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1183%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22MAX736.208MV%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%2C%22text%22%3A%22MAX5V%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A370%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A24%2C%22text%22%3A%222.8KHZ%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A612%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%2265.5MH%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1064%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A31%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%87%BA%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A855%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A23%2C%22text%22%3A%2235%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1208%2C%22y%22%3A209%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A72%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A307%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A73%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u468dd5be%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u60202bf5" id="u60202bf5"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783995934402-3111dfaf-1cb9-444c-820f-232a35bc4236.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua3e70cc1-cfe3-46f4-87f2-b7ec6022605%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A766%2C%22height%22%3A237%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A89511%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1532%2C%22originHeight%22%3A474%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%2062626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%20MAX5V%20MAX4.105V%2091.5HZ%2065.5MH%2035%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A116%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A49%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A565%2C%22y%22%3A-10%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%2062626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1016%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A49%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A2%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22MAX5V%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1216%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A21%2C%22text%22%3A%22MAX4.105V%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A25%2C%22text%22%3A%2291.5HZ%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A644%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A23%2C%22text%22%3A%2265.5MH%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A887%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A25%2C%22text%22%3A%2235%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1240%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A69%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A339%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A75%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1ef80278%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub80e5d01" id="ub80e5d01" style="text-indent: 2em; padding-left: 16em"><span data-lake-id="u697670bc" id="u697670bc">低通滤波</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7713dbe9" id="u7713dbe9"><span data-lake-id="u977224b9" id="u977224b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">再一个：滤波/平滑电流</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5e912e50" id="u5e912e50"><span data-lake-id="uee2bd961" id="uee2bd961" class="lake-fontsize-12">电感阻止电流的突变。在直流电路中，它允许直流通过，而抑制交流纹波。它与电容（抑制电压突变）组合可以构成高效的LC滤波器</span></p><p data-lake-id="u996516d7" id="u996516d7"><span data-lake-id="u19b7703d" id="u19b7703d" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如：在开关电源的Buck(降压)、Boost(升压)电路中，电感是核心储能和滤波元件，用于产生平滑的直流输出。下图为降压电路</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubb27cc09" id="ubb27cc09"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fgif%2F46168485%2F1783996015647-09364f83-81fb-4968-8001-f3117274b998.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9e6833e8-a674-4f4d-8077-aed2a4437f1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2900%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1008%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaef397e0%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="uUSHF" id="uUSHF"><span data-lake-id="uf9b5ad30" id="uf9b5ad30">3.3.2 常见电感</span></h3><p data-lake-id="93dffa019236694bf1ad887d8e30951b" id="93dffa019236694bf1ad887d8e30951b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u7765e1ff" id="u7765e1ff" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u62942f56" id="u62942f56" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）磁环电感</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ade9619767cd35cb60ced98c36666167" id="ade9619767cd35cb60ced98c36666167" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u69a30f99" id="u69a30f99" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/974868.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u093d9aaf" id="u093d9aaf"><span data-lake-id="u039660c8" id="u039660c8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/974868.html</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="4ca89e74a96ecb963b9f3f37b4e0951c" id="4ca89e74a96ecb963b9f3f37b4e0951c"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233145326-a74414bb-fbd7-43fb-944b-2f7a8fd05567.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A582%2C%22height%22%3A165%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A789%2C%22originHeight%22%3A224%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%238c8c6a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UfGev%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="a61eb31dfb5bf20a6f36bc525281f2b5" id="a61eb31dfb5bf20a6f36bc525281f2b5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua4bb92b0" id="ua4bb92b0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8aa68c0e" id="u8aa68c0e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">）贴片电感</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="254fab4abd0cecc7a86265c33afca765" id="254fab4abd0cecc7a86265c33afca765" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u36aee27e" id="u36aee27e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">购买链接：</span><a href="https://item.szlcsc.com/5869567.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u61a0939f" id="u61a0939f"><span data-lake-id="u5ed244e4" id="u5ed244e4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #0365D5">https://item.szlcsc.com/5869567.html</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="ae2207c94bfe780a04cb15d4fe8ed9b4" id="ae2207c94bfe780a04cb15d4fe8ed9b4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F46168485%2F1733233145478-ca112b28-772b-4f8b-b7e1-98ab5ea6e8da.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A609%2C%22height%22%3A179%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A795%2C%22originHeight%22%3A234%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c4c45d%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jK3Rc%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="WrmvO" id="WrmvO"><span data-lake-id="ue7086ed3" id="ue7086ed3">3.3.3 电感大小识别</span></h3><p data-lake-id="1607d31fd58c80746d12a71a5d3b0c82" id="1607d31fd58c80746d12a71a5d3b0c82" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="u42a13b34" id="u42a13b34" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">数字和字母的混合标注法：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="4d446f694be82169e5cf2edca5ec193e" id="4d446f694be82169e5cf2edca5ec193e" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8fe87926" id="u8fe87926" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">（1）电感量和允许误差采用三位数字和一位字母表示，前两位数字表示有效数字，第三位数字表示有 效数字后几个0（倍乘数）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="108480e6b7611824a31a883616be5ed4" id="108480e6b7611824a31a883616be5ed4" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="udac3e570" id="udac3e570" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如：201K（前面两位数字20是有效数字，第三位数1表示后面有1个0；英文字母K表示误差为 ±10% ），表示200uH±10% 。</span></p><p data-lake-id="492aecf59837f824f05ee52c824f43e4" id="492aecf59837f824f05ee52c824f43e4" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ucf95c969" id="ucf95c969" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">（2）数字和“R” 、“N” 混合标注，常用于小功率电感（如一些贴片电感），如用“R” 表示小数点是，电感 量的单位通常为uH。如用“N” 表示小数点，单位通常为nH。</span></p><p data-lake-id="095faaedd53ba3786cc518f11a9e8a65" id="095faaedd53ba3786cc518f11a9e8a65" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua0ce0e98" id="ua0ce0e98" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">例如：4R7J（R表示小数点；英文字母J表示误差±5% ），表示4.7uH ±5%。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucaf2ab22" id="ucaf2ab22"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="mfFAJ" id="mfFAJ"><span data-lake-id="ucafa89d1" id="ucafa89d1" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u14d51112" id="u14d51112" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">四、保险丝和熔断器</span></h1><h1 data-lake-id="hBo45" id="hBo45"><span data-lake-id="u41b7fa4e" id="u41b7fa4e" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u601703b2" id="u601703b2" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">5.1概念介绍</span></h1><p data-lake-id="udce2e64b" id="udce2e64b"><span data-lake-id="u434e88b8" id="u434e88b8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u07a2df3f" id="u07a2df3f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">保险丝和熔断器保险丝和熔断器都是用来保护电路免受过载或 短路等电气故障的设备。<br /></span><span data-lake-id="uce5d3085" id="uce5d3085" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">保险丝是一种电气元件，通常由金属丝或铜箔制成，其作用是在电流过载时断开电路，以保 护电路中其他电气元件不受损坏。当电流达到或超过保险丝的额定电流时，保险丝中的金属丝或铜箔会被加热，最终熔断，中断电路，以避免电气火灾等危险情况。<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u0875913c" id="u0875913c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">熔断器与保险丝类似，与保险丝不同，熔断器通常可以重复使用。熔断器的另一个优点是它们通常比保险丝更快地响应电气故障，因此能更好地保护电路。<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="ucea79b4f" id="ucea79b4f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733174287318-0a81ad24-7b16-4bef-8658-2efd99935f1a.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_806%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A372%2C%22height%22%3A234%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A806%2C%22originHeight%22%3A507%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c4b8ac%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aQW4l%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ib1Vw" id="ib1Vw"><span data-lake-id="u72e8cbc3" id="u72e8cbc3" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="ucd808dbc" id="ucd808dbc" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">5.2保险丝和熔断器参数</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uffd0ae2a" id="uffd0ae2a"><span data-lake-id="ud7d64b5a" id="ud7d64b5a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u41a05ad6" id="u41a05ad6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">购买元器件最重要的就是参数<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u2c2bf0fb" id="u2c2bf0fb" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">熔断速度：慢速、中速、快速、特快速<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u3fe6249a" id="u3fe6249a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">快速熔断器：熔断时间小于0.001秒<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u50ad88de" id="u50ad88de" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">电压额定值：所能承受的最高电压<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u3609553a" id="u3609553a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">电流额定值：所能承受的最高电流<br /></span><span data-lake-id="uce7498a8" id="uce7498a8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">熔断特性：快速熔断器适用于对电路的保护，要求较高的场合，能够在短时间内切断过载电流或短路电流；而慢速熔断器则适用于对电路保护要求不高的场合，能够在一定时间内承受额定电流的2-3倍电流。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uffd072e1" id="uffd072e1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733175668309-36b9a0ba-6946-473f-b5cc-5138ad9b2a8f.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_750%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A385%2C%22height%22%3A288%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A750%2C%22originHeight%22%3A561%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23696a5c%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mNIlJ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="UmIb1" id="UmIb1"><span data-lake-id="ua5b7dfea" id="ua5b7dfea" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u999e7162" id="u999e7162" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">六、安全警示</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uc4ad6c0a" id="uc4ad6c0a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176731281-04cdfd91-4e7a-4fd1-ae11-b9d03d2033f0.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_852%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A442%2C%22height%22%3A334%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A852%2C%22originHeight%22%3A643%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23646b6a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RnNtO%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1c0f158a" id="u1c0f158a"><span data-lake-id="u0ce6e287" id="u0ce6e287" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="u19fe31ff" id="u19fe31ff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176746999-60122087-cc02-465e-8e06-b53fd14d595d.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_848%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A326%2C%22height%22%3A244%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A848%2C%22originHeight%22%3A634%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%237e6955%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wnSri%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3a2e299" id="ud3a2e299" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua8ac51f3" id="ua8ac51f3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176774218-a1115897-b9e8-40e3-b72f-c40632cf8659.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_844%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A242%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A844%2C%22originHeight%22%3A635%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%235a6168%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sZe2k%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: var(--yq-text-primary)"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="zSmuf" id="zSmuf"><span data-lake-id="u810afb18" id="u810afb18"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u64926bd6" id="u64926bd6">七、接插件</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ufb841630" id="ufb841630"><span data-lake-id="u7c0f1a8e" id="u7c0f1a8e" class="lake-fontsize-12"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u137aa805" id="u137aa805" class="lake-fontsize-12">开关、按键、连接端子本质上都是电路连接器<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="uff4a5ab1" id="uff4a5ab1"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176808263-e5f89ebc-bbe1-4aed-9e8b-fd01f9371245.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_1500%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A606%2C%22height%22%3A223%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1500%2C%22originHeight%22%3A551%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KsmJR%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5144b5c7" id="u5144b5c7"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176822632-9cfa9f2e-9cf4-472b-acf7-ceb8ff16e122.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_1116%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A483%2C%22height%22%3A282%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1116%2C%22originHeight%22%3A652%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eae7e5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XDhby%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d28dc1f" id="u6d28dc1f" class="lake-fontsize-12"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="uae294ae3" id="uae294ae3"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176832804-77ab4cdb-10bc-4c67-9bd2-bafd9a7285f1.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_1026%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A469%2C%22height%22%3A251%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1026%2C%22originHeight%22%3A549%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ededec%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VU4nQ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u176481b5" id="u176481b5" class="lake-fontsize-12"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="ub21ccaa2" id="ub21ccaa2"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733176847022-b336e8d2-5960-4473-9f16-643a86948b31.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_1189%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A471%2C%22height%22%3A252%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1189%2C%22originHeight%22%3A636%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cabfa9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OTidv%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="gVJ4T" id="gVJ4T"><span data-lake-id="ue77a7355" id="ue77a7355"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u7e7a243c" id="u7e7a243c">八、毫安时和毫瓦时</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uf9d873c7" id="uf9d873c7"><span data-lake-id="uf5c44495" id="uf5c44495" class="lake-fontsize-12"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u0224fd14" id="u0224fd14" class="lake-fontsize-12">毫安时和毫瓦时是两个不同的物理量，他们分别表示电量和能量的度量单位。下面图片是我们在拼多多上搜索的18650得到的结果<br /></span><span data-lake-id="u97d82a92" id="u97d82a92" class="lake-fontsize-12">问：哪个电池更好<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="u8dcd3d3d" id="u8dcd3d3d"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733180187378-da9053df-903d-4ea2-b8f7-40d9a0bfb21e.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_634%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A264%2C%22height%22%3A237%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A634%2C%22originHeight%22%3A570%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2395c177%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OKPMq%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5f79dab3" id="u5f79dab3"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733180194237-c74b3723-e1e8-4a99-a1f7-c27e4c608b72.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_624%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A236%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A624%2C%22originHeight%22%3A561%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bfc0b3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FkAnQ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="DEd1S" id="DEd1S"><span data-lake-id="u6998aa56" id="u6998aa56"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="ueaad4656" id="ueaad4656">9.1一节5号电池有几度电</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u67bd53f0" id="u67bd53f0"><span data-lake-id="u727ea426" id="u727ea426" class="lake-fontsize-12"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="uf507e51e" id="uf507e51e" class="lake-fontsize-12">5号电池的容量800mAh</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud34b6065" id="ud34b6065"><span data-lake-id="uede67b12" id="uede67b12">5号电池的电压是1.5V, 1.5V乘以0.8得到的是1.2wh,说明5号电池以1.2瓦的功率工作可以工作1小时，1度电又叫一千瓦时。1000除以1.2等于833，也就是833节5号电池相当于1度电。 电，一度电5毛钱。不到50元的电费，跑500公里，所以非常非常划算。特斯拉含有7000节18650电池，每个18650电池12.5瓦时，充满特斯拉汽车需要12.5*7000的能量，约等于87.5度</span></p><p data-lake-id="u693c4abf" id="u693c4abf"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F45508326%2F1733180348380-666391d5-b11c-48f1-b9be-c7cc1918f0b8.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_666%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A285%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A666%2C%22originHeight%22%3A506%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cba78b%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L3qBf%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="oeHkd" id="oeHkd"><span data-lake-id="u21da823b" id="u21da823b">十、芯片</span></h1><h3 data-lake-id="zNKMq" id="zNKMq"><span data-lake-id="uc6b39f87" id="uc6b39f87">芯片封装</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u6237ce52" id="u6237ce52"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783996125059-3d44c85e-af85-485e-8077-8f6ee7a0ccaa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uef819382-2728-4c9d-94c7-ad60d6d3c46%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A556%2C%22height%22%3A419%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A962811%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1511%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1138%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%2262626%20TO-220%20QFP-44%20BGA%20QFN-8%207771%20QFN-16%20DIP%20QFP-100%20SOT23-5%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%20%E8%AE%BF%E5%AE%A262626%202626%20QFN-48%20SOP-8%20DO-214AC%20VQFN-32%2062626%20%E5%AE%A262626%20LGA12%20QFN64%