/MPU/SOC)厂家_型号_价格_规格_品牌-立创商城</span></a></p><h3 data-lake-id="KGnIY" id="KGnIY"><span data-lake-id="u9abbbcbf" id="u9abbbcbf">MCU：</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ub722f71b" id="ub722f71b"><span data-lake-id="u4b678e58" id="u4b678e58">据Morgan Stanley 分析预测，随着中国本地微控制器市场规模飙升，到2025年，国产微控制器的占比将达到20-25%如处理运行速度，8位MCU通常以8 MHz运行，而32位MCU的时脉频率则可达数百MHz，目前国内不少MCU企业立足于32位MCU的创新发展。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2afb6617" id="u2afb6617"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1783996245702-d09ecc03-0a59-425a-8008-05a5b2bddcc2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u38f128d2-5419-4086-9252-9cda4d517b1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f250b19-ea29-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A792.5%2C%22height%22%3A777%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A709548%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1585%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1553%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%20%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E5%8E%82%E5%95%86%20LOGO%20%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%2C%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%BA%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%2C%E7%94%B5%E6%9C%BA%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%2C%E5%AE%89%E9%98%B2%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7.%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%B6%20%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%85%86%E6%98%93%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%20%E5%B1%85%2C%E7%89%A9%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%20GIGADEVICE%2062626%2062626%20MINDMOTION%20%E7%94%B5%E6%9C%BA%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6.%E8%93%9D%E7%89%99%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%2C%E9%AB%98%E6%B8%85%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%2C%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%2C%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%BA%2C%E5%BE%AE%20SOC%20SOKRTIONS%202%20%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E7%81%B5%E5%8A%A8%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%20%E5%9E%8B%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E6%9C%BA%2C%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%2C%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E7%83%9F%2CLED%E7%82%B9%E9%98%B5%E5%B1%8F%E5%AD%90%20%E8%87%B4%E5%8A%9B%E4%BA%8E%E7%89%A9%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%2C%E8%BD%A6%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%2C%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4