</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0a631d69" id="u0a631d69"><p data-lake-id="ub3fdfa98" id="ub3fdfa98"><span data-lake-id="u8791d95d" id="u8791d95d">通用计算</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u24c5be42" id="u24c5be42"><p data-lake-id="uc7719fde" id="uc7719fde"><span data-lake-id="ud36f546c" id="ud36f546c">并行计算</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u25cf1b8b" id="u25cf1b8b"><td data-lake-id="u19af9c32" id="u19af9c32"><p data-lake-id="u8d03cbbd" id="u8d03cbbd"><span data-lake-id="u00ca257f" id="u00ca257f">主要任务</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uef82e2f9" id="uef82e2f9"><p data-lake-id="u2d5ba99a" id="u2d5ba99a"><span data-lake-id="ud2ec599b" id="ud2ec599b">控制传感器、电机、通信等</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2323c135" id="u2323c135"><p data-lake-id="ubc521381" id="ubc521381"><span data-lake-id="ueae12bc7" id="ueae12bc7">运行操作系统、软件程序</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u040e9408" id="u040e9408"><p data-lake-id="ud9e860d2" id="ud9e860d2"><span data-lake-id="u054adb9a" id="u054adb9a">图像处理、AI计算、大规模并行运算</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub1c492b4" id="ub1c492b4"><td data-lake-id="u4da22d4a" id="u4da22d4a"><p data-lake-id="uc886feaa" id="uc886feaa"><span data-lake-id="u5c84020e" id="u5c84020e">典型应用</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc3fc42a6" id="uc3fc42a6"><p data-lake-id="uebf27850" id="uebf27850"><span data-lake-id="u0b420039" id="u0b420039">STM32、ESP32、8051</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8a60b268" id="u8a60b268"><p data-lake-id="u429e665c" id="u429e665c"><span data-lake-id="u2023ab6a" id="u2023ab6a">Intel Core、AMD Ryzen、ARM Cortex-A</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u20d847b9" id="u20d847b9"><p data-lake-id="u4f0a5bf6" id="u4f0a5bf6"><span data-lake-id="u8636ee95" id="u8636ee95">NVIDIA RTX、AMD Radeon</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc00c4058" id="uc00c4058"><td data-lake-id="u69c1cd6a" id="u69c1cd6a"><p data-lake-id="u35f67b54" id="u35f67b54"><span data-lake-id="u05261ec9" id="u05261ec9">是否集成存储</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua18bcb11" id="ua18bcb11"><p data-lake-id="u3127